msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "Autentikasi"

msgid "User registration"
msgstr "Pendaftaran pengguna"

msgid ""
"The default setup for Weblate is to use python-social-auth, a form on the "
"website to handle registration of new users. After confirming their e-mail a "
"new user can contribute or authenticate by using one of the third party "
"services."
msgstr ""
"Pengaturan bawaan untuk Weblate adalah menggunakan python-social-auth, "
"formulir di situs web untuk menangani pendaftaran pengguna baru. Setelah "
"mengkonfirmasikan surel mereka, pengguna baru dapat berkontribusi atau "
"mengautentikasikan dengan menggunakan salah satu layanan pihak ketiga."

msgid ""
"You can also turn off registration of new users "
"using :setting:`REGISTRATION_OPEN`."
msgstr ""
"Anda juga dapat mematikan pendaftaran pengguna baru "
"menggunakan :setting:`REGISTRATION_OPEN`."

msgid "The authentication attempts are subject to :ref:`rate-limit`."
msgstr "Percobaan autentikasi tunduk pada :ref:`rate-limit`."

msgid "Authentication backends"
msgstr "Backend autentikasi"

msgid ""
"Weblate relies on Django for the authentication. This includes built-in "
"password-based authentication, social authentication, and third-party "
"authentication backends for Django."
msgstr ""
"Weblate mengandalkan Django untuk autentikasi. Ini mencakup autentikasi "
"berbasis kata sandi bawaan, autentikasi sosial, dan backend autentikasi "
"pihak ketiga untuk Django."

msgid ""
"Using Django's built-in authentication means you can import the user "
"database of other Django-based projects (see :ref:`pootle-migration`)."
msgstr ""
"Menggunakan autentikasi bawaan Django berarti Anda dapat mengimpor basis "
"data pengguna proyek berbasis Django lainnya (lihat :ref:`pootle-migration`)."

msgid ""
":ref:`docker-auth` describes how to configure authentication in the official "
"Docker image."
msgstr ""
":ref:`docker-auth` menjelaskan cara mengkonfigurasikan autentikasi di gambar "
"Docker resmi."

msgid "Social authentication"
msgstr "Autentikasi sosial"

msgid ""
"Thanks to :doc:`psa:index`, Weblate support authentication using many third "
"party services such as GitLab, Ubuntu, Fedora, etc."
msgstr ""
"Berkat :doc:`psa:index`, Weblate mendukung autentikasi menggunakan banyak "
"layanan pihak ketiga seperti GitLab, Ubuntu, Fedora, dll."

msgid ""
"Please check their documentation for generic configuration instructions "
"in :doc:`psa:configuration/django`."
msgstr ""
"Silakan periksa dokumentasi mereka untuk melihat petunjuk konfigurasi umum "
"di :doc:`psa:configuration/django`."

msgid ""
"By default, Weblate relies on third-party authentication services to provide "
"a validated e-mail address. If some of the services you want to use don't "
"support this, please enforce e-mail validation on the Weblate side by "
"configuring FORCE_EMAIL_VALIDATION for them. For example:"
msgstr ""
"Secara bawaan, Weblate mengandalkan layanan autentikasi pihak ketiga untuk "
"memberikan alamat surel yang divalidasi. Jika beberapa layanan yang ingin "
"Anda gunakan tidak mendukung ini, harap terapkan validasi surel di sisi "
"Weblate dengan mengkonfigurasikan FORCE_EMAIL_VALIDATION untuk layanan "
"tersebut. Sebagai contoh:"

msgid ""
"Enabling individual backends is quite easy, it's just a matter of adding an "
"entry to the :setting:`django:AUTHENTICATION_BACKENDS` setting and possibly "
"adding keys needed for a given authentication method. Please note that some "
"backends do not provide user e-mail by default, you have to request it "
"explicitly, otherwise Weblate will not be able to properly credit "
"contributions users make."
msgstr ""
"Mengaktifkan backend individual cukup mudah, hanya masalah penambahan entri "
"ke pengaturan :setting:`django:AUTHENTICATION_BACKENDS` dan mungkin "
"menambahkan kunci yang diperlukan untuk metode autentikasi yang diberikan. "
"Harap dicatat bahwa beberapa backend tidak menyediakan surel pengguna secara "
"bawaan, Anda harus memintanya secara eksplisit, jika tidak, Weblate tidak "
"akan dapat mengkredit kontribusi yang dibuat pengguna dengan benar."

msgid ""
"Most of the authentication backends require HTTPS. Once HTTPS is enabled in "
"your web server please configure Weblate to report it properly "
"using :setting:`ENABLE_HTTPS`, or by :envvar:`WEBLATE_ENABLE_HTTPS` in the "
"Docker container."
msgstr ""
"Sebagian besar backend autentikasi memerlukan HTTPS. Setelah HTTPS "
"diaktifkan di server web Anda, silakan konfigurasikan Weblate untuk "
"melaporkannya dengan benar menggunakan :setting:`ENABLE_HTTPS`, atau "
"dengan :envvar:`WEBLATE_ENABLE_HTTPS` di kontainer Docker."

msgid ":doc:`Python Social Auth backend <psa:backends/index>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Backend Auth Sosial Python <psa:backends/index>`"

msgid "OpenID authentication"
msgstr "Autentikasi OpenID"

msgid ""
"For OpenID-based services it's usually just a matter of enabling them. The "
"following section enables OpenID authentication for OpenSUSE, Fedora and "
"Ubuntu:"
msgstr ""
"Untuk layanan berbasis OpenID biasanya hanya masalah pengaktifannya. Bagian "
