msgstr "Autentikasi GitHub"

msgid ""
"You need to register an OAuth application on GitHub and then tell Weblate "
"all its secrets:"
msgstr ""
"Anda perlu mendaftarkan aplikasi OAuth di GitHub kemudian memberi tahu "
"Weblate semua rahasianya:"

