msgid ""
"Import validation of uploaded project backups can be tuned "
"using :setting:`PROJECT_BACKUP_IMPORT_MAX_MEMBERS`, :setting:`PROJECT_BACKUP_IMPORT_MAX_TOTAL_UNCOMPRESSED_SIZE`, :setting:`PROJECT_BACKUP_IMPORT_MAX_COMPRESSED_ENTRY_SIZE`, :setting:`PROJECT_BACKUP_IMPORT_MIN_RATIO_SIZE`, "
"and :setting:`PROJECT_BACKUP_IMPORT_MAX_COMPRESSED_ENTRY_RATIO`."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The complete backup is validated before restoring any data. Invalid object "
"fields, references, repository paths, URLs, regular expressions, or "
"screenshot files cause the import to be rejected without creating a partial "
"project."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Use the generated file to import project when :ref:`adding-projects` or "
"in :wladmin:`import_projectbackup`."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan berkas yang dihasilkan untuk mengimpor proyek saat :ref:`adding-"
"projects` atau di :wladmin:`import_projectbackup`."

msgid ""
"Restoring of the backup might fail if the restoring server has different set "
"of :ref:`languages` or different configuration "
"of :setting:`SIMPLIFY_LANGUAGES`. The restore will tell you which language "
"codes could not be processed and you can then add missing language "
"definitions manually."
msgstr ""
"Pemulihan cadangan mungkin gagal jika server pemulihan memiliki "
"rangkaian :ref:`languages` yang berbeda atau "
"konfigurasi :setting:`SIMPLIFY_LANGUAGES` yang berbeda. Pemulihan akan "
"memberi tahu Anda kode bahasa mana yang tidak dapat diproses dan Anda "
"kemudian dapat menambahkan definisi bahasa yang hilang secara manual."

msgid "Automated backup using BorgBackup"
msgstr "Pencadangan otomatis menggunakan BorgBackup"

msgid ""
"Weblate has built-in support for creating service backups using "
"`BorgBackup`_. Borg creates space-effective encrypted backups which can be "
"safely stored in the cloud. The backups can be controlled in the management "
"interface from the :guilabel:`Backups` tab."
msgstr ""
"Weblate memiliki dukungan bawaan untuk membuat cadangan layanan menggunakan "
"`BorgBackup`_. Borg membuat cadangan terenkripsi hemat ruang yang dapat "
"disimpan dengan aman di awan. Cadangan dapat dikontrol di antarmuka "
"pengelolaan dari tab :guilabel:`Cadangan`."

msgid "PostgreSQL databases are included in the automated backups."
msgstr "Basis data PostgreSQL disertakan dalam cadangan terotomatis."

msgid ""
"The backups using Borg are incremental and Weblate is configured to keep "
"following backups:"
msgstr ""
"Pencadangan menggunakan Borg bersifat inkremental dan Weblate "
"dikonfigurasikan untuk menyimpan cadangan berikut:"

msgid "Daily backups for 14 days back"
msgstr "Pencadangan harian selama 14 hari ke belakang"

msgid "Weekly backups for 8 weeks back"
msgstr "Pencadangan mingguan selama 8 minggu ke belakang"

msgid "Monthly backups for 6 months back"
msgstr "Pencadangan bulanan selama 6 bulan ke belakang"

msgid "Borg encryption key"
msgstr "Kunci enkripsi Borg"

msgid ""
"`BorgBackup`_ creates encrypted backups and you wouldn’t be able to restore "
"them without the passphrase. The passphrase is generated when adding a new "
"backup service and you should copy it and keep it in a secure place."
msgstr ""
"`BorgBackup`_ membuat cadangan terenkripsi dan Anda tidak akan dapat "
"memulihkannya tanpa frasa sandi. Frasa sandi dibuat saat menambahkan layanan "
"pencadangan baru dan Anda harus menyalinnya dan menyimpannya di tempat yang "
"aman."

msgid ""
"If you are using :ref:`cloudbackup`, please backup your private SSH key too, "
"as it’s used to access your backups."
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda menggunakan :ref:`cloudbackup`, harap cadangkan juga kunci SSH "
"privat Anda karena akan digunakan untuk mengakses cadangan Anda."

msgid "Customizing backup"
msgstr "Menyesuaikan pencadangan"

msgid "The database backup can be configured via :setting:`DATABASE_BACKUP`."
msgstr ""
"Pencadangan basis data dapat dikonfigurasikan "
"melalui :setting:`DATABASE_BACKUP`."

msgid "The backup creation can be customized using :setting:`BORG_EXTRA_ARGS`."
msgstr ""
"Pembuatan cadangan dapat dikonfigurasikan "
"menggunakan :setting:`BORG_EXTRA_ARGS`."

msgid "Weblate provisioned backup storage"
msgstr "Penyimpanan cadangan yang disediakan oleh Weblate"

msgid ""
"The easiest way of backing up your Weblate instance is purchasing the "
"`backup service at weblate.org <https://weblate.org/support/#backup>`_. This "
"is how you get it running:"
msgstr ""
"Cara termudah untuk mencadangkan instansi Weblate Anda adalah dengan membeli "
"`layanan cadangan di weblate.org <https://weblate.org/support/#backup>`_. "
"Ini adalah panduan untuk menjalankannya:"

msgid "Purchase the `Backup service` on https://weblate.org/support/#backup."
msgstr "Beli `Layanan cadangan` di https://weblate.org/support/#backup."

msgid ""
"Enter the obtained key in the management interface, see :ref:`activate-"
"support`."
msgstr ""
"Masukkan kunci yang diperoleh di antarmuka pengelolaan, lihat :ref:`activate-"
"support`."

msgid ""
"Weblate connects to the cloud service and obtains access info for the "
"backups."
msgstr ""
"Weblate terhubung ke layanan awan dan memperoleh informasi akses untuk "
"cadangan."

msgid "Turn on the new backup configuration from the :guilabel:`Backups` tab."
msgstr "Aktifkan konfigurasi cadangan baru dari tab :guilabel:`Cadangan`."

msgid ""
"Backup your Borg credentials to be able to restore the backups, "
"see :ref:`borg-keys`."
msgstr ""
"Cadangkan kredensial Borg Anda untuk dapat memulihkan pencadangan, "
"lihat :ref:`borg-keys`."

msgid ""
"The manual step of turning everything on is there for your safety. Without "
"your consent no data is sent to the backup repository obtained through the "
"registration process."
msgstr ""
"Langkah manual untuk pemakaian semuanya ada demi keselamatan Anda. Tanpa "
"persetujuan Anda, tidak ada data yang dikirim ke repositori cadangan yang "
"diperoleh melalui proses pendaftaran."

msgid "Using custom backup storage"
msgstr "Menggunakan penyimpanan cadangan kustom"

msgid ""
"You can also use your own storage for the backups. SSH can be used to store "
"backups in the remote destination, the target server needs to have "
"`BorgBackup`_ installed."
msgstr ""
"Anda juga dapat menggunakan penyimpanan Anda sendiri untuk pencadangan. SSH "
"dapat digunakan untuk menyimpan cadangan di destinasi jarak jauh, server "
"target harus memasang `BorgBackup`_."

msgid ":doc:`borg:usage/general` in the Borg documentation"
msgstr ":doc:`borg:usage/general` dalam dokumentasi Borg"

msgid "Local filesystem"
msgstr "Sistem berkas lokal"

msgid ""
"It is recommended to specify the absolute path for the local backup, for "
"example `/path/to/backup`. The directory has to be writable by the user "
"running Weblate (see :ref:`file-permissions`). If it doesn't exist, Weblate "
"attempts to create it but needs the appropriate permissions to do so."
msgstr ""
"Direkomendasikan untuk menentukan lokasi mutlak untuk rekam cadang lokal, "
"misalnya `/path/to/backup`. Direktori harus dapat ditulis oleh pengguna yang "
"menjalankan Weblate (lihat :ref:`file-permissions`). Jika tidak ada, Weblate "
"akan mencoba membuatnya, tetapi memerlukan izin yang sesuai untuk "
"melakukannya."

msgid ""
"When running Weblate in Docker, please ensure the backup location is exposed "
"as a volume from the Weblate container. Otherwise the backups will be "
"discarded by Docker upon restarting the container it is in."
msgstr ""
"Saat menjalankan Weblate di Docker, pastikan lokasi cadangan ditampilkan "
"sebagai volume dari kontainer Weblate. Jika tidak, cadangan akan dibuang "
"oleh Docker setelah memulai ulang kontainernya."

msgid ""
"One option is to place backups into an existing volume, for example :file:`/"
"app/data/borgbackup`. This is an existing volume in the container."
msgstr ""
"Salah satu opsi adalah menempatkan cadangan ke dalam volume yang ada, "
"misalnya :file:`/app/data/borgbackup`. Ini adalah volume yang ada dalam "
"kontainer."

msgid ""
"You can also add a new container for the backups in the Docker Compose file "
"for example by using :file:`/borgbackup`:"
msgstr ""
"Anda juga dapat menambahkan kontainer baru untuk cadangan di berkas Docker "
"Compose, misalnya dengan menggunakan :file:`/borgbackup`:"

#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The directory where backups will be stored have to be owned by UID 1000, "
#| "otherwise Weblate won’t be able to write the backups there."
msgid ""
"The directory where backups will be stored has to be owned by UID 1000, "
"otherwise Weblate won’t be able to write the backups there."
msgstr ""
"Direktori tempat cadangan yang akan disimpan harus dimiliki oleh UID 1000, "
"jika tidak, Weblate tidak akan dapat menulis rekam cadang di sana."

msgid "Remote backups"
msgstr "Pencadangan jarak jauh"

msgid ""
"For creating remote backups, you will have to install `BorgBackup`_ onto "
"another server that’s accessible for your Weblate deployment via SSH using "
"the Weblate SSH key:"
msgstr ""
"Untuk membuat rekam cadang jarak jauh, Anda harus memasang `BorgBackup`_ ke "
"server lain yang dapat diakses untuk penyebaran Weblate Anda melalui SSH "
"menggunakan kunci SSH Weblate:"

msgid "Prepare a server where your backups will be stored."
msgstr "Siapkan server tempat cadangan Anda akan disimpan."

msgid ""
"Install the SSH server on it (you will get it by default with most Linux "
"distributions)."
msgstr ""
"Pasang server SSH di dalamnya (Anda akan mendapatkannya secara bawaan di "
"sebagian besar distribusi Linux)."

msgid ""
"Install `BorgBackup`_ on that server; most Linux distributions have packages "
"available (see :doc:`borg:installation`)."
msgstr ""
"Pasang `BorgBackup`_ pada server tersebut. Kebanyakan distribusi Linux "
"memiliki paket yang tersedia (lihat :doc:`borg:installation`)."

msgid ""
"Choose an existing user or create a new user that will be used for backing "
"up."
msgstr ""
"Pilih pengguna yang sudah ada atau buat pengguna baru yang akan digunakan "
"untuk pencadangan."

msgid ""
"Add Weblate SSH key to the user's `.ssh/authorized_keys` file, so that "
"Weblate can SSH to the server without a password (see :ref:`weblate-ssh-"
"key`)."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan kunci SSH Weblate ke berkas `.ssh/authorized_keys` pengguna, "
"sehingga Weblate dapat men-SSH ke server tanpa kata sandi "
"(lihat :ref:`weblate-ssh-key`)."

msgid ""
"Create a user-writable directory where Weblate can remotely set up the Borg "
"backup repository, for example in the home directory (i.e. ``/home/borg/"
"backups``)."
msgstr ""
"Buat direktori yang dapat ditulis oleh pengguna tempat Weblate dapat "
"menyiapkan repositori cadangan Borg dari jarak jauh, misalnya di direktori "
"beranda (yaitu ``/home/borg/backups``)."

msgid ""
"Configure the backup location in Weblate as ``user@host:/home/borg/backups`` "
"or ``ssh://user@host:port/home/borg/backups``."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurasikan lokasi pencadangan di Weblate sebagai ``user@host:/home/borg/"
"backups`` atau ``ssh://user@host:port/home/borg/backups``."

#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Once enabled, the backups will be triggered automatically daily. You can "
#| "also manually trigger a backup from the Weblate UI."
msgid ""
"Once enabled, the backups will be triggered automatically daily. You can "
"also manually trigger a backup from the Weblate UI or using :ref:`backup-"
"management-command`."
msgstr ""
"Setelah diaktifkan, pencadangan akan dijalankan secara otomatis setiap hari. "
"Anda juga dapat memicu pencadangan secara manual dari antarmuka Weblate."

msgid ""
":ref:`cloudbackup` provides you automated remote backups without any effort."
msgstr ""
":ref:`cloudbackup` memberi Anda pencadangan jarak jauh secara otomatis."

msgid "Restoring from BorgBackup"
msgstr "Memulihkan dari BorgBackup"

msgid ""
"Restore access to your backup repository and prepare your backup passphrase."
msgstr ""
"Pulihkan akses ke repositori cadangan Anda dan siapkan kata sandi cadangan "
"Anda."

msgid "List all the backups on the server using ``borg list REPOSITORY``."
msgstr ""
"Buat daftar semua cadangan di server menggunakan ``borg list REPOSITORY``."

msgid ""
"Restore the desired backup to the current directory using ``borg extract "
"REPOSITORY::ARCHIVE``."
msgstr ""
"Pulihkan cadangan yang diinginkan ke direktori saat ini dengan menggunakan "
"``borg extract REPOSITORY::ARCHIVE``."

msgid ""
"Restore the database from the SQL dump placed in the ``backup`` directory in "
"the Weblate data dir (see :ref:`backup-dumps`)."
msgstr ""
"Pulihkan basis data dari buangan SQL yang ditempatkan di direktori "
"``backup`` di dir data Weblate (lihat :ref:`backup-dumps`)."

msgid ""
"Copy the Weblate configuration (:file:`backups/settings.py`, "
"see :ref:`backup-dumps`) to the correct location, see :ref:`configuration`."
msgstr ""
"Salin konfigurasi Weblate (:file:`backups/settings.py`, lihat :ref:`backup-"
"dumps`) ke lokasi yang benar, lihat :ref:`configuration`."

msgid ""
"When using Docker container, the settings file is already included in the "
"container and you should restore the original environment variables. "
"The :file:`environment.yml` file might help you with this (see :ref:`backup-"
"dumps`)."
msgstr ""
"Ketika menggunakan kontainer Docker, berkas pengaturan sudah disertakan di "
"dalam kontainer dan Anda harus memulihkan variabel lingkungan yang asli. "
"Berkas :file:`environment.yml` dapat membantu Anda dalam hal ini "
"(lihat :ref:`backup-dumps`)."

msgid ""
"Copy the whole restored data dir to the location configured "
"by :setting:`DATA_DIR`."
msgstr ""
"Salin seluruh direktori data yang dipulihkan ke lokasi yang dikonfigurasikan "
"oleh :setting:`DATA_DIR`."

msgid ""
"When using Docker container place the data into the data volume, "
"see :ref:`docker-volume`."
msgstr ""
"Saat menggunakan kontainer Docker, tempatkan data ke dalam volume data, "
"lihat :ref:`docker-volume`."

msgid ""
"Please ensure the files have correct ownership and permissions, "
"see :ref:`file-permissions`."
msgstr ""
"Pastikan berkas memiliki kepemilikan dan izin yang benar, lihat :ref:`file-"
"permissions`."

