"di :file:`settings.py` atau :envvar:`WEBLATE_SILENCED_SYSTEM_CHECKS` untuk "
"Docker."

msgid "Database"
msgstr "Basis data"

msgid "The actual storage location depends on your database setup."
msgstr ""
"Lokasi penyimpanan sesungguhnya bergantung pada pengaturan basis data Anda."

msgid ""
"The database is the most important storage. Set up regular backups of your "
"database. Without the database, all the translations are gone."
msgstr ""
"Basis data adalah penyimpanan yang paling penting. Siapkan pencadangan basis "
"data Anda secara teratur. Tanpa basis data, semua terjemahan akan hilang."

msgid "Native database backup"
msgstr "Pencadangan basis data asli"

#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The recommended approach is to save a dump of the database using database-"
#| "native tools such as :program:`pg_dump` or :program:`mysqldump`. It "
#| "usually performs better than Django backup, and it restores complete "
#| "tables with all their data."
msgid ""
"The recommended approach is to save a dump of the database using database-"
"native tools such as :program:`pg_dump`. It usually performs better than "
"Django backup, and it restores complete tables with all their data."
msgstr ""
"Pendekatan yang direkomendasikan adalah menyimpan buangan dari basis data "
"menggunakan alat basis data asli seperti :program:`pg_dump` "
"atau :program:`mysqldump`. Ini biasanya memiliki kinerja yang lebih baik "
"dibandingkan dengan pencadangan Django dan ini dapat memulihkan tabel secara "
"lengkap dengan semua datanya."

msgid ""
"You can restore this backup in a newer Weblate release, it will perform all "
"the necessary migrations when running in :wladmin:`migrate`. Please "
"consult :doc:`upgrade` on more detailed info on how to upgrade between "
"versions."
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat memulihkan cadangan ini di versi Weblate yang lebih baru. Versi "
"ini akan menjalankan semua migrasi yang diperlukan saat dijalankan "
"di :wladmin:`migrate`. Silakan lihat :doc:`upgrade` untuk informasi "
"terperinci lebih lanjut tentang cara meningkatkan antar versi."

msgid "Django database backup"
msgstr "Pencadangan basis data Django"

msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can back up your database using "
"Django's :djadmin:`django:dumpdata` command. That way the backup is database "
"agnostic and can be used in case you want to change the database backend."
msgstr ""
"Sebagai alternatif, Anda dapat mencadangkan basis data Anda menggunakan "
"perintah Django :djadmin:`django:dumpdata`. Dengan cara tersebut, cadangan "
"bersifat agnostik basis data dan dapat digunakan jika Anda ingin mengubah "
"backend basis data."

msgid ""
"Prior to restoring the database you need to be running exactly the same "
"Weblate version the backup was made on. This is necessary as the database "
"structure does change between releases and you would end up corrupting the "
"data in some way. After installing the same version, run all database "
"migrations using :wladmin:`migrate`."
msgstr ""
"Sebelum memulihkan basis data, Anda harus menjalankan versi Weblate yang "
"sama persis dengan versi cadangan. Hal ini diperlukan karena struktur basis "
"data dapat berubah di setiap rilis dan dapat mengakibatkan kerusakan data. "
"Setelah memasang versi yang sama, jalankan semua migrasi basis data "
"menggunakan :wladmin:`migrate`."

msgid ""
"Afterwards some entries will already be created in the database and you will "
"have them in the database backup as well. The recommended approach is to "
"delete such entries manually using the management shell (see :ref:`invoke-"
"manage`):"
msgstr ""
"Setelah itu, beberapa entri akan dibuat di dalam basis data dan Anda akan "
"memilikinya dalam pencadangan basis data juga. Pendekatan yang "
"direkomendasikan adalah menghapus entri tersebut secara manual dengan "
"menggunakan pengelolaan shell (lihat :ref:`invoke-manage`):"

msgid "Files"
msgstr "Berkas"

msgid ""
"If you have enough backup space, simply back up the "
"whole :setting:`DATA_DIR`. This is a safe bet even if it includes some files "
"you don't want. The following sections describe what you should back up and "
"what you can skip in detail."
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda memiliki ruang pencadangan yang cukup, silakan cadangkan "
"seluruh :setting:`DATA_DIR`. Ini adalah taruhan yang aman bahkan jika "
"terdapat beberapa berkas yang tidak Anda inginkan. Bagian berikut ini "
"menjelaskan apa yang harus Anda cadangkan dan apa yang bisa Anda lewati "
"secara rinci."

msgid "Dumped data for backups"
msgstr "Data yang dibuang untuk cadangan"

msgid ""
"The environment dump was added as :file:`environment.yml` to help in "
"restoring in the Docker environments."
msgstr ""
"Buangan lingkungan ditambahkan sebagai :file:`environment.yml` untuk "
"membantu dalam pemulihan di lingkungan Docker."

msgid "Stored in :setting:`DATA_DIR` ``/backups``."
msgstr "Disimpan di :setting:`DATA_DIR` ``/backups``."

msgid ""
"Weblate dumps various data here, and you can include these files for more "
"complete backups. The files are updated daily (requires a running Celery "
"beats server, see :ref:`celery`). Currently, this includes:"
msgstr ""
"Weblate membuang berbagai data di sini, dan Anda dapat menyertakan berkas "
"ini untuk pencadangan yang lebih lengkap. Berkas ini diperbarui setiap hari "
"(memerlukan server Celery beats yang berjalan, lihat :ref:`celery`). Saat "
"ini, berkas ini mencakup:"

msgid ""
"Weblate settings as :file:`settings.py` (there is also expanded version "
"in :file:`settings-expanded.py`)."
msgstr ""
"Pengaturan Weblate sebagai :file:`settings.py` (ada juga versi yang "
"diluaskan di :file:`settings-expanded.py`)."

msgid "PostgreSQL database backup as :file:`database.sql`."
msgstr "Pencadangan basis data PostgreSQL sebagai :file:`database.sql`."

msgid "Environment dump as :file:`environment.yml`."
msgstr "Buangan lingkungan sebagai :file:`environment.yml`."

msgid ""
"The database backups are saved as plain text by default, but they can also "
"be compressed or entirely skipped using :setting:`DATABASE_BACKUP`."
msgstr ""
"Pencadangan basis data disimpan sebagai teks biasa secara bawaan, tetapi "
"mereka juga dapat dikompresi atau seluruhnya dilewati "
"menggunakan :setting:`DATABASE_BACKUP`."

msgid ""
"To restore the database backup, load it using database tools, for example:"
msgstr ""
"Untuk memulihkan cadangan basis data, muat menggunakan alat basis data, "
"misalnya:"

msgid "Version control repositories"
msgstr "Repositori kontrol versi"

msgid "Stored in :setting:`DATA_DIR` ``/vcs``."
msgstr "Disimpan di :setting:`DATA_DIR` ``/vcs``."

msgid ""
"The version control repositories contain a copy of your upstream "
"repositories with Weblate changes. If you have :ref:`component-"
"push_on_commit` enabled for all your translation components, all Weblate "
"changes are included upstream. No need to back up the repositories on the "
"Weblate side as they can be cloned again from the upstream location with no "
"data loss."
msgstr ""
"Repositori kontrol versi berisi salinan repositori hulu Anda dengan "
"perubahan Weblate. Jika Anda mengaktifkan :ref:`component-push_on_commit` "
