msgid "Periodic tasks using Celery beat"
msgstr "Tugas berkala menggunakan Celery beat"

msgid ""
"Weblate comes with built-in setup for scheduled tasks. The task schedule is "
"stored in the database and tasks are executed by the Celery beat daemon."
msgstr ""
"Weblate dilengkapi dengan pengaturan bawaan untuk tugas terjadwal. Jadwal "
"tugas disimpan dalam basis data dan tugas dieksekusi oleh daemon Celery beat."

msgid ""
"You can define additional tasks in :file:`settings.py`, for example "
"see :ref:`lazy-commit`."
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat mendefinisikan tugas tambahan di :file:`settings.py`, misalnya "
"lihat :ref:`lazy-commit`."

msgid "Monitoring Celery status"
msgstr "Memantau status Celery"

msgid ""
"You can find current length of the Celery task queues in "
"the :ref:`management-interface` or you can use :wladmin:`celery_queues` on "
"the command-line. In case the queue will get too long, you will also get "
"configuration error in the admin interface."
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat menemukan panjang antrian tugas Celery saat ini "
"di :ref:`management-interface` atau menggunakan :wladmin:`celery_queues` di "
"baris perintah. Jika antrian terlalu panjang, Anda juga akan mendapatkan "
"galat konfigurasi di antarmuka admin."

msgid ""
"The Celery errors are by default only logged into Celery log and are not "
"visible to user. In case you want to have overview on such failures, it is "
"recommended to configure :ref:`collecting-errors`."
msgstr ""
"Galat Celery secara bawaan hanya dicatat ke dalam catatan Celery dan tidak "
"terlihat oleh pengguna. Jika Anda ingin melihat ikhtisar kegagalan tersebut, "
"disarankan untuk mengkonfigurasikan :ref:`collecting-errors`."

