"diintegrasikan ke dalam konfigurasi Docker Compose Anda dan bekerja bersama "
"Weblate."

msgid "When adding third-party containers, consider the following:"
msgstr "Saat menambahkan kontainer pihak ketiga, pertimbangkan hal berikut:"

msgid ""
"**Network connectivity**: Ensure containers can communicate with each other "
"by placing them on the same Docker network"
msgstr ""
"**Konektivitas jaringan**: Pastikan kontainer dapat berkomunikasi satu sama "
"lain dengan menempatkannya di jaringan Docker yang sama"

msgid ""
"**Data persistence**: Use volumes for services that need to persist data"
msgstr ""
"**Persistensi data**: Gunakan volume untuk layanan yang perlu menyimpan data"

msgid ""
"**Security**: Configure appropriate access controls and avoid exposing "
"unnecessary ports"
msgstr ""
"**Keamanan**: Konfigurasikan kontrol akses yang sesuai dan hindari "
"mengekspos port yang tidak diperlukan"

msgid "LibreTranslate Docker container integration"
msgstr "Integrasi kontainer Docker LibreTranslate"

msgid ""
"`LibreTranslate <https://libretranslate.com/>`_ is a free and open-source "
"machine translation service that can be self-hosted. Integrating it with "
"Weblate provides offline machine translation capabilities without relying on "
"external services."
msgstr ""
"`LibreTranslate <https://libretranslate.com/>`_ adalah layanan terjemahan "
"mesin bebas dan sumber terbuka yang dapat dihos sendiri. Integrasinya dengan "
"Weblate menyediakan kemampuan terjemahan mesin luring tanpa bergantung pada "
"layanan eksternal."

msgid ""
"You can incorporate the LibreTranslate service into your Weblate deployment "
"by including it in a :file:`docker-compose.override.yml` file. Since it runs "
"within the Docker network, it's only accessible to Weblate and not exposed "
"to the public internet."
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat mengintegrasikan layanan LibreTranslate ke dalam deployment "
"Weblate Anda dengan memasukkannya ke dalam berkas :file:`docker-"
"compose.override.yml`. Karena berjalan di dalam jaringan Docker, layanan ini "
"hanya dapat diakses oleh Weblate dan tidak dapat diakses melalui internet "
"publik."

msgid "Basic setup using :file:`docker-compose.override.yml`:"
msgstr "Pengaturan dasar menggunakan :file:`docker-compose.override.yml`:"

msgid "For GPU-accelerated translation (if you have NVIDIA GPU available):"
msgstr ""
"Untuk terjemahan yang dipercepat GPU (jika Anda memiliki GPU NVIDIA yang "
"tersedia):"

msgid ""
"After starting the services with ``docker compose down && docker compose up "
"-d``, configure LibreTranslate in Weblate:"
msgstr ""
"Setelah memulai layanan dengan ``docker compose down && docker compose up "
"-d``, konfigurasikan LibreTranslate di Weblate:"

msgid "Access the Weblate admin interface"
msgstr "Akses antarmuka admin Weblate"

msgid ""
"Navigate to :guilabel:`Machine translation` → :guilabel:`Automatic "
"suggestions`"
msgstr ""
"Navigasikan ke :guilabel:`Terjemahan mesin` → :guilabel:`Saran otomatis`"

msgid "Add a new LibreTranslate service with:"
msgstr "Tambahkan layanan LibreTranslate baru dengan:"

msgid "Service"
msgstr "Layanan"

msgid "LibreTranslate"
msgstr "LibreTranslate"

msgid "API URL"
msgstr "URL API"

msgid "API key"
msgstr "Kunci API"

msgid "Leave empty"
msgstr "Biarkan kosong"

msgid ""
"LibreTranslate is now configured and available for machine translation in "
"Weblate."
msgstr ""
"LibreTranslate sekarang dikonfigurasikan dan tersedia untuk terjemahan mesin "
"di Weblate."

msgid ""
"The LibreTranslate service runs without the web UI (``--disable-web-ui``) "
"and is only accessible via the API within the Docker network."
msgstr ""
"Layanan LibreTranslate berjalan tanpa UI web (``--disable-web-ui``) dan "
"hanya dapat diakses melalui API dalam jaringan Docker."

msgid ""
"Models are automatically updated when the container starts. "
"(``LT_UPDATE_MODELS: true``)"
msgstr ""
"Model diperbarui secara otomatis saat kontainer dimulai. "
"(``LT_UPDATE_MODELS: true``)"

msgid ""
"Data is persisted using Docker volumes for optimal performance and data "
"safety."
msgstr ""
"Data disimpan menggunakan volume Docker untuk kinerja dan keamanan data yang "
"optimal."

msgid ""
"Health checks ensure that the Docker engine properly observes the state of "
"the service."
msgstr ""
"Pemeriksaan kesehatan memastikan bahwa mesin Docker mengamati status layanan "
"dengan benar."

msgid ""
"For GPU acceleration, use the CUDA image variant and ensure your system has "
"NVIDIA Docker support. This container runs as a privileged user to be able "
"to use the GPU."
msgstr ""
"Untuk akselerasi GPU, gunakan varian citra CUDA dan pastikan sistem Anda "
"mendukung NVIDIA Docker. Kontainer ini berjalan sebagai pengguna akses agar "
"dapat menggunakan GPU."

msgid "No external ports are exposed, making the setup secure by default."
msgstr ""
"Tidak ada port eksternal yang terbuka, membuat pengaturan aman secara bawaan."

msgid "`LibreTranslate Docker documentation`_"
msgstr "`Dokumentasi Docker LibreTranslate`_"

msgid "Anubis Docker container integration"
msgstr "Integrasi kontainer Anubis Docker"

msgid ""
"`Anubis`_ is a web AI firewall utility to block AI scrapers and other "
"disruptive traffic on the server. It is typically needed for publicly open "
"Weblate installations to avoid excessive load caused by scraping."
msgstr ""
"`Anubis`_ adalah utilitas firewall AI web untuk memblokir scraper AI dan "
"lalu lintas mengganggu lainnya di server. Biasanya diperlukan untuk "
"instalasi Weblate yang terbuka untuk umum guna menghindari beban berlebih "
"akibat scraping."

msgid "Anubis can be deployed using Docker Compose:"
msgstr "Anubis dapat disebarkan menggunakan Docker Compose:"

msgid ""
"The ``anubis-data`` volume in the above configuration is expected to "
"contain :file:`botPolicies.yaml` with a bot policy configured to your needs."
msgstr ""
"Volume ``anubis-data`` dalam konfigurasi di atas diharapkan "
"berisi :file:`botPolicies.yaml` dengan kebijakan bot yang dikonfigurasikan "
"sesuai kebutuhan Anda."

msgid ""
"At minimum, you need to adjust status codes as described in https://"
"anubis.techaro.lol/docs/admin/configuration/subrequest-auth."
msgstr ""
"Minimalnya, Anda perlu menyesuaikan kode status seperti yang dijelaskan di "
"https://anubis.techaro.lol/docs/admin/configuration/subrequest-auth."

msgid ""
"It is also recommended to configure persistent storage backend as described "
"in https://anubis.techaro.lol/docs/admin/policies/#storage-backends."
msgstr ""
"Disarankan juga untuk mengkonfigurasikan backend penyimpanan persisten "
"seperti yang dijelaskan di https://anubis.techaro.lol/docs/admin/policies/"
"#storage-backends."

msgid "You can then turn on the Anubis usage in Weblate using:"
msgstr ""
"Anda kemudian dapat menyalakan penggunaan Anubis di Weblate menggunakan:"

msgid "Configuring PostgreSQL server"
msgstr "Mengkonfigurasikan server PostgreSQL"

msgid ""
"The PostgreSQL container uses default PostgreSQL configuration and it won't "
"effectively utilize your CPU cores or memory. It is recommended to customize "
"the configuration to improve the performance."
msgstr ""
"Kontainer PostgreSQL menggunakan konfigurasi PostgreSQL bawaan dan tidak "
"akan memanfaatkan inti CPU atau memori Anda secara efektif. Disarankan untuk "
"menyesuaikan konfigurasi guna meningkatkan kinerja."

msgid ""
"The configuration can be adjusted as described in `Database Configuration` "
"at https://hub.docker.com/_/postgres. The configuration matching your "
"environment can be generated using https://pgtune.leopard.in.ua/."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurasi dapat disesuaikan seperti yang dijelaskan dalam `Konfigurasi "
"Basis Data` di https://hub.docker.com/_/postgres. Konfigurasi yang sesuai "
"dengan lingkungan Anda dapat dibuat menggunakan https://"
"pgtune.leopard.in.ua/."

msgid "Container internals"
msgstr "Internal kontainer"

msgid ""
"The container is using :program:`supervisor` to start individual services. "
"In case of :ref:`docker-scaling`, it only starts single service in a "
"container."
msgstr ""
"Kontainer menggunakan :program:`supervisor` untuk memulai layanan "
"individual. Dalam kasus :ref:`docker-scaling`, kontainer hanya memulai satu "
"layanan dalam satu kontainer."

msgid "To check the services status use:"
msgstr "Untuk memeriksa status layanan gunakan:"

msgid ""
"There are individual services for each Celery queue (see :ref:`celery` for "
"details). You can stop processing some tasks by stopping the appropriate "
"worker:"
msgstr ""
"Terdapat layanan individual untuk setiap antrian Celery (lihat :ref:`celery` "
"untuk rinciannya). Anda dapat menghentikan pemrosesan beberapa tugas dengan "
"menghentikan pekerja yang sesuai:"

msgid "Installing on Kubernetes"
msgstr "Memasang di Kubernetes"

msgid ""
"This guide is looking for contributors experienced with Kubernetes to cover "
"the setup in more details."
msgstr ""
"Panduan ini mencari kontributor berpengalaman dengan Kubernetes untuk "
"membahas penyiapannya secara lebih rinci."

msgid ""
"With the Kubernetes Helm chart you can get your personal Weblate instance up "
"and running in seconds. All of Weblate’s dependencies are already included. "
"PostgreSQL is set up as the default database and persistent volume claims "
"are used."
msgstr ""
"Dengan bagan Kubernetes Helm, Anda dapat menjalankan instansi Weblate "
"pribadi Anda dalam hitungan detik. Semua dependensi Weblate sudah "
"disertakan. PostgreSQL diatur sebagai basis data bawaan dan klaim volume "
"persisten digunakan."

msgid ""
"You can find the chart at <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/helm/> and it can "
"be displayed at <https://artifacthub.io/packages/helm/weblate/weblate>."
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat menemukan bagan tersebut di <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/helm/> "
"dan dapat ditampilkan di <https://artifacthub.io/packages/helm/weblate/"
"weblate>."

msgid ""
"For further configuration options, see :ref:`docker-environment` for full "
"list of environment variables."
msgstr ""
"Untuk pilihan konfigurasi lebih lanjut, lihat :ref:`docker-environment` "
"untuk daftar lengkap variabel lingkungan."

msgid "Installing on OpenShift"
msgstr "Memasang di OpenShift"

msgid ""
"With the OpenShift Weblate template you can get your personal Weblate "
"instance up and running in seconds. All of Weblate’s dependencies are "
"already included. PostgreSQL is set up as the default database and "
"persistent volume claims are used."
msgstr ""
"Dengan templat OpenShift Weblate, Anda dapat langsung menjalankan instansi "
"Weblate pribadi Anda dalam hitungan detik. Semua dependensi Weblate sudah "
"disertakan. PostgreSQL diatur sebagai basis data bawaan dan klaim volume "
"persisten digunakan."

msgid ""
"You can find the template at <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/openshift/>."
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat menemukan templatnya di <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/openshift/"
">."

msgid ""
"The following examples assume you have a working OpenShift v3.x environment, "
"with ``oc`` client tool installed. Please check the OpenShift documentation "
"for instructions."
msgstr ""
"Contoh berikut mengasumsikan Anda memiliki lingkungan OpenShift v3.x yang "
"berfungsi, dengan alat klien ``oc`` terpasang. Silakan periksa dokumentasi "
"OpenShift untuk petunjuk lebih lanjut."

msgid ""
"The :file:`template.yml` is suited for running all components in OpenShift. "
"There is also :file:`template-external-postgresql.yml` which does not start "
"a PostgreSQL server and allows you to configure external PostgreSQL server."
msgstr ""
":file:`template.yml` cocok untuk menjalankan semua komponen di OpenShift. "
"Terdapat juga :file:`template-external-postgresql.yml` yang tidak memulai "
"server PostgreSQL dan mengizinkan Anda mengkonfigurasikan server PostgreSQL "
"eksternal."

msgid "Web Console"
msgstr "Konsol Web"

msgid ""
"Copy the raw content from `template.yml <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/"
"openshift/blob/main/template.yml>`_ and import them into your project, then "
"use the :guilabel:`Create` button in the OpenShift web console to create "
"your application. The web console will prompt you for the values for all of "
"the parameters used by the template."
msgstr ""
"Salin konten mentah dari `template.yml <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/"
"openshift/blob/main/template.yml>`_ dan impor ke proyek Anda, lalu gunakan "
"tombol :guilabel:`Buat` di konsol web OpenShift untuk membuat aplikasi Anda. "
"Konsol web akan meminta Anda memasukkan nilai untuk semua parameter yang "
"digunakan oleh templat."

msgid "CLI"
msgstr "CLI"

msgid ""
"To upload the Weblate template to your current project’s template library, "
"pass the :file:`template.yml` file with the following command:"
msgstr ""
"Untuk mengunggah templat Weblate ke pustaka templat proyek Anda saat ini, "
"berikan berkas :file:`template.yml` dengan perintah berikut:"

msgid ""
"The template is now available for selection using the web console or the CLI."
msgstr ""
"Templat sekarang tersedia untuk dipilih menggunakan konsol web atau CLI."

msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Parameter"

msgid ""
"The parameters that you can override are listed in the parameters section of "
"the template. You can list them with the CLI by using the following command "
"and specifying the file to be used:"
msgstr ""
"Parameter yang dapat Anda timpa tercantum di bagian parameter templat. Anda "
"dapat mencantumkannya melalui CLI dengan menggunakan perintah berikut dan "
"menentukan berkas yang akan digunakan:"

msgid "Provisioning"
msgstr "Penyediaan"

msgid ""
"You can also use the CLI to process templates and use the configuration that "
"is generated to create objects immediately."
msgstr ""
"Anda juga dapat menggunakan CLI untuk memproses templat dan menggunakan "
"konfigurasi yang dihasilkan untuk segera membuat objek."

msgid ""
"The Weblate instance should be available after successful migration and "
"deployment at the specified ``WEBLATE_SITE_DOMAIN`` parameter."
msgstr ""
"Instansi Weblate seharusnya tersedia setelah migrasi dan penyebaran berhasil "
"pada parameter ``WEBLATE_SITE_DOMAIN`` yang ditentukan."

msgid ""
"After container setup, you can sign in as `admin` user with password "
"provided in ``WEBLATE_ADMIN_PASSWORD``, or a random password generated on "
"first start if that was not set."
msgstr ""
"Setelah pengaturan kontainer, Anda dapat masuk sebagai pengguna `admin` "
"dengan kata sandi yang diberikan dalam ``WEBLATE_ADMIN_PASSWORD``, atau kata "
"sandi acak yang dibuat saat pertama kali memulai jika tidak diatur."

msgid ""
"To reset `admin` password, restart the container with "
"``WEBLATE_ADMIN_PASSWORD`` set to new password in the respective ``Secret``."
msgstr ""
"Untuk mengatur ulang kata sandi `admin`, mulai ulang kontainer dengan "
"``WEBLATE_ADMIN_PASSWORD`` yang diatur ke kata sandi baru dalam ``Secret`` "
"masing-masing."

msgid "Eliminate"
msgstr "Hilangkan"

msgid ""
"By processing the template a respective ``ConfigMap`` will be created and "
"which can be used to customize the Weblate image. The ``ConfigMap`` is "
"directly mounted as environment variables and triggers a new deployment "
"every time it is changed. For further configuration options, "
"see :ref:`docker-environment` for full list of environment variables."
msgstr ""
"Dengan memproses templat, ``ConfigMap`` yang sesuai akan dibuat dan dapat "
"digunakan untuk menyesuaikan gambar Weblate. ``ConfigMap`` dipasang langsung "
"sebagai variabel lingkungan dan memicu penyebaran baru setiap kali diubah. "
"Untuk opsi konfigurasi lebih lanjut, lihat :ref:`docker-environment` untuk "
"daftar lengkap variabel lingkungan."

msgid "Installing from sources"
msgstr "Memasang dari sumber"

msgid ""
"Please follow the installation instructions for your system first up to "
"installing Weblate:"
msgstr ""
"Silakan ikuti petunjuk pemasangan untuk sistem Anda terlebih dahulu hingga "
"pemasangan Weblate:"

msgid ""
"Grab the latest Weblate sources using Git (or download a tarball and unpack "
"that):"
msgstr ""
"Ambil sumber Weblate terbaru menggunakan Git (atau unduh tarball dan "
"ekstrak):"

msgid ""
"Alternatively you can use released archives. You can download them from our "
"website <https://weblate.org/>. Those downloads are cryptographically "
"signed, please see :ref:`verify`."
msgstr ""
"Alternatifnya, Anda dapat menggunakan arsip yang telah dirilis. Anda dapat "
"mengunduhnya dari situs web kami <https://weblate.org/>. Unduhan tersebut "
"ditandatangani secara kriptografis, silakan lihat :ref:`verify`."

msgid "Install current Weblate code into the Python environment:"
msgstr "Pasang kode Weblate saat ini ke dalam lingkungan Python:"

msgid ""
"If you intend to run the testsuite from the source checkout, install the "
"development dependencies as described in :ref:`local-tests`."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Copy :file:`weblate/settings_example.py` to :file:`weblate/settings.py`."
msgstr ""
"Salin :file:`weblate/settings_example.py` ke :file:`weblate/settings.py`."

msgid "Create the database used by Weblate, see :ref:`database-setup`."
msgstr ""
"Buat basis data yang digunakan oleh Weblate, lihat :ref:`database-setup`."

msgid ""
"Build Django tables, static files and initial data (see :ref:`tables-setup` "
"and :ref:`static-files`):"
msgstr ""
"Bangun tabel Django, berkas statis dan data awal (lihat :ref:`tables-setup` "
"dan :ref:`static-files`):"

msgid "This step should be repeated whenever you update the repository."
msgstr "Langkah ini harus diulang jika Anda memperbarui repositori."

msgid "Packaging Weblate for distributions"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The dependency versions in :file:`pyproject.toml` describe the runtime "
"environment tested by the Weblate project. They are intentionally strict for "
"installs from PyPI and for the Weblate release process, because Weblate "
"cannot validate every dependency-version combination covered by wider "
"version ranges."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Distribution packages can replace those Python packages with versions from "
"the distribution package set. When doing so, run Weblate's test suite "
"against the packaged dependency set and treat passing tests as the "
"compatibility signal for the distribution package."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Keep Weblate's tightly coupled companion packages in sync with the Weblate "
"release:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Mismatched versions of these packages are more likely to break at runtime or "
"during tests than other Python dependency substitutions."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"See :ref:`local-tests` for test setup and :ref:`release-cycle` for Weblate's "
"release cadence."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Adjust the values in the new :file:`settings.py` file to your liking. You "
"will need to provide at least the database credentials and Django secret "
"key, but you will want more changes for production setup, "
"see :ref:`configuration`."
msgstr ""
"Sesuaikan nilai dalam berkas :file:`settings.py` yang baru sesuai keinginan "
"Anda. Anda perlu memberikan setidaknya kredensial basis data dan kunci "
"rahasia Django, tetapi Anda akan memerlukan lebih banyak perubahan untuk "
"pengaturan produksi, lihat :ref:`configuration`."

msgid "Hardware requirements"
msgstr "Persyaratan perangkat keras"

msgid ""
"Weblate should run on any contemporary hardware without problems, the "
"following is the minimal configuration required to run Weblate on a single "
"host (Weblate, database and web server):"
msgstr ""
"Weblate seharusnya dapat berjalan pada perangkat keras apa pun saat ini "
"tanpa masalah, berikut ini adalah konfigurasi minimal yang diperlukan untuk "
"menjalankan Weblate pada hos tunggal (Weblate, basis data, dan server web):"

msgid "3 GB of RAM"
msgstr "RAM 3 GB"

msgid "2 CPU cores"
msgstr "2 inti CPU"

msgid "1 GB of storage space"
msgstr "Ruang penyimpanan 1 GB"

msgid ""
"Actual requirements for your installation of Weblate vary heavily based on "
"the size of the translations managed in it."
msgstr ""
"Persyaratan sebenarnya untuk pemasangan Weblate Anda sangat bervariasi "
"berdasarkan ukuran terjemahan yang dikelola di dalamnya."

msgid "Memory usage"
msgstr "Penggunaan memori"

msgid ""
"The more memory the better - it is used for caching on all levels (file "
"system, database and Weblate). For hundreds of translation components, at "
"least 4 GB of RAM is recommended."
msgstr ""
"Semakin besar memori, semakin baik - memori tersebut digunakan untuk "
"penyimpanan di semua tingkatan (sistem berkas, basis data, dan Weblate). "
"Untuk ratusan komponen terjemahan, RAM minimal 4 GB direkomendasikan."

msgid ""
"For systems with less memory than recommended, :ref:`minimal-celery` is "
"recommended."
msgstr ""
"Untuk sistem dengan memori lebih sedikit dari yang "
"direkomendasikan, :ref:`minimal-celery` direkomendasikan."

msgid "CPU usage"
msgstr "Penggunaan CPU"

msgid "Many concurrent users increase the amount of needed CPU cores."
msgstr ""
"Banyak pengguna bersamaan meningkatkan jumlah inti CPU yang diperlukan."

msgid "Storage usage"
msgstr "Penggunaan penyimpanan"

msgid ""
"The typical database storage usage is around 300 MB per 1 million hosted "
"words."
msgstr ""
"Penggunaan penyimpanan basis data pada umumnya adalah sekitar 300 MB per 1 "
"juta kata yang dihos."

msgid ""
"Storage space needed for cloned repositories varies, but Weblate tries to "
"keep their size minimal by doing shallow clones."
msgstr ""
"Ruang penyimpanan yang dibutuhkan untuk repositori kloning bervariasi, "
"tetapi Weblate mencoba menjaga ukurannya tetap minimal dengan melakukan "
"kloning dangkal."

