msgid "Upgrading Weblate"
msgstr "Meningkatkan Weblate"

msgid "Docker image upgrades"
msgstr "Peningkatan gambar Docker"

msgid ""
"The official Weblate Docker image (see :doc:`install/docker`) integrates all "
"upgrade steps. Typically, no manual interaction is needed beyond pulling the "
"latest (or at least newer) version."
msgstr ""
"Gambar Docker Weblate resmi (lihat :doc:`install/docker`) mengintegrasikan "
"semua langkah peningkatan. Biasanya, tidak diperlukan interaksi manual "
"selain menarik versi terbaru (atau setidaknya yang lebih baru)."

msgid "Generic upgrade instructions"
msgstr "Petunjuk peningkatan umum"

msgid ""
"Always look for new changes to :ref:`requirements` before upgrading. Once "
"all requirements are installed or upgraded, ensure your :file:`settings.py` "
"matches the changes in the configuration "
"(consult :file:`settings_example.py` for correct values)."
msgstr ""
"Selalu periksa perubahan baru pada :ref:`requirements` sebelum melakukan "
"peningkatan. Setelah semua persyaratan terpasang atau ditingkatkan, "
"pastikan :file:`settings.py` Anda sesuai dengan perubahan konfigurasi "
"(lihat :file:`settings_example.py` untuk nilai yang benar)."

msgid ""
"Always check :ref:`version-specific-instructions` before upgrading. If you "
"are skipping any versions, be sure to follow instructions for all versions "
"you are skipping during such upgrade. It's sometimes better to upgrade "
"gradually to an intermediate version to ensure a smooth migration. Upgrading "
"across multiple releases should work, but is not as well tested as single "
"version upgrades!"
msgstr ""
"Selalu periksa :ref:`version-specific-instructions` sebelum melakukan "
"peningkatan. Jika Anda melewatkan versi apa pun, pastikan untuk mengikuti "
"petunjuk untuk semua versi yang Anda lewatkan selama peningkatan tersebut. "
"Terkadang lebih baik untuk meningkatkan secara bertahap ke versi perantara "
"untuk memastikan migrasi yang lancar. Meningkatkan beberapa rilis seharusnya "
"berhasil, tetapi tidak teruji sebaik peningkatan versi tunggal!"

msgid ""
"Always back up the full database before upgrading, so that you can roll back "
"the database if the upgrade fails, see :doc:`backup`."
msgstr ""
"Selalu cadangkan seluruh basis data sebelum melakukan peningkatan, sehingga "
"Anda dapat mengembalikan basis data jika peningkatan gagal, "
"lihat :doc:`backup`."

