msgid "Bulk accepting suggestions from a specific user in :ref:`suggestions`."
msgstr "Menerima saran massal dari pengguna tertentu di :ref:`suggestions`."

msgid "Cloning suggestions into translation in :ref:`suggestions`."
msgstr "Mengkloning saran ke dalam terjemahan di :ref:`suggestions`."

msgid ""
":setting:`HIDE_SHARED_GLOSSARY_COMPONENTS` to hide glossaries shared into "
"other projects."
msgstr ""
":setting:`HIDE_SHARED_GLOSSARY_COMPONENTS` untuk menyembunyikan glosarium "
"yang dibagikan ke proyek lain."

msgid ""
"Added new management command :wladmin:`list_change_events`, which lists all "
"possible change events, :ref:`addon-choice-events`."
msgstr ""
"Menambahkan perintah pengelolaan baru :wladmin:`list_change_events`, yang "
"mencantumkan semua kemungkinan peristiwa perubahan, :ref:`addon-choice-"
