msgid "Weblate 5.15"
msgstr "Weblate 5.15"

msgid "*Released on December 15th 2025.*"
msgstr "*Dirilis pada 15 Desember 2025.*"

msgid ""
"Batch automatic translation can now be manually triggered at project "
"language, category or component level, see :ref:`auto-translation`."
msgstr ""
"Terjemahan otomatis penjumlahan kini dapat dipicu secara manual di tingkat "
"bahasa proyek, kategori, atau komponen, lihat :ref:`auto-translation`."

msgid ""
"Added ability to completely disable the admin contact form by "
"setting :setting:`CONTACT_FORM` to ``\"disabled\"``."
msgstr ""
"Menambahkan kemampuan untuk sepenuhnya menonaktifkan formulir kontak admin "
"dengan mengatur :setting:`CONTACT_FORM` ke ``\"disabled\"``."

msgid ""
"Added new Ollama machinery tool for local Ollama AI model integration, "
"see :ref:`mt-ollama`."
msgstr ""
"Menambahkan alat mesin Ollama baru untuk integrasi model AI Ollama lokal, "
"lihat :ref:`mt-ollama`."

msgid ""
"Added :http:get:`/api/units/(int:id)/comments/` to get a list of comments "
"for the given translation unit."
msgstr ""
"Menambahkan :http:get:`/api/units/(int:id)/comments/` untuk mendapatkan "
"daftar komentar untuk unit terjemahan yang diberikan."

msgid "Memory contents imported from TMX files include string context."
msgstr "Konten memori yang diimpor dari berkas TMX mencakup konteks string."

msgid ""
":doc:`/formats/xliff2`, :doc:`/formats/nextcloud-json`, :doc:`/formats/"
"resjson`, and :doc:`/formats/toml` are now supported file formats."
msgstr ""
":doc:`/formats/xliff2`, :doc:`/formats/nextcloud-json`, :doc:`/formats/"
"resjson`, dan :doc:`/formats/toml` sekarang merupakan format berkas yang "
"didukung."

msgid ""
":ref:`addon-weblate.fedora_messaging.publish` integration is now available "
"as add-on."
msgstr ""
"Integrasi :ref:`addon-weblate.fedora_messaging.publish` kini tersedia "
"sebagai pengaya."

msgid "Added :ref:`check-laravel-format` quality check."
msgstr "Menambahkan pemeriksaan kualitas :ref:`check-laravel-format`."

msgid "Added disk usage overview in :ref:`manage-performance`."
msgstr "Menambahkan ikhtisar penggunaan cakram di :ref:`manage-performance`."

msgid ":http:get:`/api/groups/` now includes ``admins``."
msgstr ":http:get:`/api/groups/` sekarang menyertakan ``admins``."

msgid ":ref:`mt-modernmt` better supports language variants."
msgstr ":ref:`mt-modernmt` lebih mendukung varian bahasa."

msgid ""
"Automatically translated strings are now identified by a dedicated flag "
"instead of a label."
msgstr ""
"String yang diterjemahkan secara otomatis sekarang diidentifikasi oleh "
"penanda khusus alih-alih label."

msgid ""
":ref:`addon-weblate.discovery.discovery` preserves :ref:`file_format_params`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`addon-weblate.discovery.discovery` "
"mempertahankan :ref:`file_format_params`."

msgid ":ref:`mt-cyrtranslit` now supports Belarusian and Greek."
msgstr ":ref:`mt-cyrtranslit` sekarang mendukung Belarusia dan Yunani."

msgid ""
":ref:`block-user` now accepts internal notes that are not visible to the "
"user."
msgstr ""
":ref:`block-user` kini menerima catatan internal yang tidak terlihat oleh "
"pengguna."

msgid ""
":ref:`addon-weblate.webhook.slack` and :ref:`addon-weblate.webhook.webhook` "
"can be installed multiple times."
msgstr ""
":ref:`addon-weblate.webhook.slack` dan :ref:`addon-weblate.webhook.webhook` "
"dapat dipasang beberapa kali."

msgid "Compatibility with Git SHA256 repositories."
msgstr "Kompatibilitas dengan repositori Git SHA256."

msgid ""
"The allowed version control URLs can now be configured "
"using :setting:`VCS_ALLOW_SCHEMES` and :setting:`VCS_ALLOW_HOSTS`."
msgstr ""
"URL kontrol versi yang diizinkan kini dapat dikonfigurasikan "
"menggunakan :setting:`VCS_ALLOW_SCHEMES` dan :setting:`VCS_ALLOW_HOSTS`."

msgid ""
"The API timeout for creating pull requests or forking can now be configured "
"via :setting:`VCS_API_TIMEOUT`."
msgstr ""
"Batas waktu API untuk membuat permintaan tarik atau fork sekarang dapat "
"dikonfigurasi melalui :setting:`VCS_API_TIMEOUT`."

msgid ""
"Improved VCS integration documentation to clarify Docker environment "
"variables, commit authorship, hosted vs. self-hosted setup, and "
"authentication options."
msgstr ""
"Dokumentasi integrasi VCS yang lebih baik untuk memperjelas variabel "
"lingkungan Docker, kepemilikan komit, pengaturan yang dihos vs. dihos "
"sendiri, dan opsi autentikasi."

msgid "Timestamps from past are now shown with more detail."
msgstr ""
"Stempel waktu dari masa lampau sekarang ditampilkan dengan lebih rinci."

msgid ""
"Added two new :ref:`states` to provide more detailed tracking of work-in-"
"progress translations."
msgstr ""
"Menambahkan dua :ref:`states` baru untuk memberikan pelacakan yang lebih "
"terperinci terhadap terjemahan yang sedang dalam proses pengerjaan."

msgid ""
"Improper invitation validation upon accepting "
"(:cve:`2025-64725` / :ghsa:`m6hq-f4w9-qrjj`)."
msgstr ""
"Validasi undangan yang tidak tepat saat menerima "
"(:cve:`2025-64725` / :ghsa:`m6hq-f4w9-qrjj`)."

msgid ""
"Server-Side Request Forgery while cloning repository "
"(:cve:`2025-66407` / :ghsa:`hfpv-mc5v-p9mm`)."
msgstr ""
"Serangan Permintaan Sisi-Server saat mengkloning repositori "
"(:cve:`2025-66407` / :ghsa:`hfpv-mc5v-p9mm`)."

msgid ""
"Over‑permissive webhook endpoint enabling mass repository updates plus "
"component enumeration (:cve:`2025-67492` / :ghsa:`pj86-258h-qrvf`)."
msgstr ""
"Titik akhir kait web yang terlalu permisif memungkinkan pembaruan repositori "
"massal plus enumerasi komponen (:cve:`2025-67492` / :ghsa:`pj86-258h-qrvf`)."

msgid ""
"Notification settings disclosure via Weblate API "
"(:cve:`2025-67715` / :ghsa:`3pmh-24wp-xpf4`)."
msgstr ""
"Pengungkapan pengaturan notifikasi melalui API Weblate "
"(:cve:`2025-67715` / :ghsa:`3pmh-24wp-xpf4`)."

msgid ""
":ref:`mt-deepl` integration now correctly handles translating to Chinese "
"variants."
msgstr ""
"Integrasi :ref:`mt-deepl` sekarang menangani terjemahan ke varian Mandarin "
"dengan benar."

msgid ""
":doc:`/formats/csv` format saving translations with empty source fields when "
"using monolingual base files."
msgstr ""
"Format :doc:`/formats/csv` menyimpan terjemahan dengan kolom sumber kosong "
"saat menggunakan berkas dasar ekabahasa."

msgid ""
"Tighter validation of user and full names to avoid confusing homoglyphs."
msgstr ""
"Validasi yang lebih ketat pada nama pengguna dan nama lengkap untuk "
"menghindari karakter mirip (homoglif) yang membingungkan."

msgid "Avoid false positive checks upon committing pending changes."
msgstr ""
"Hindari kesalahan positif palsu saat mengkomit perubahan yang tertunda."

msgid "Performance improvements for file upload."
msgstr "Peningkatan kinerja untuk pengunggahan berkas."

msgid "Show glossary matches for the source language."
msgstr "Tampilkan pencocokan glosarium untuk bahasa sumber."

msgid "Pull/merge requests are now only created when necessary."
msgstr "Permintaan tarik/gabung sekarang hanya dibuat bila diperlukan."

msgid ""
"Replaced custom ``RequireLoginMiddleware`` with Django 5.1's "
"``LoginRequiredMiddleware``. This makes settings ``LOGIN_REQUIRED_URLS`` and "
"``LOGIN_REQUIRED_URLS_EXCEPTIONS`` no longer supported, including their "
"Docker environment variable counterparts."
msgstr ""
"Digantikan ``RequireLoginMiddleware`` kustom dengan "
"``LoginRequiredMiddleware`` milik Django 5.1. Hal ini membuat pengaturan "
"``LOGIN_REQUIRED_URLS`` dan ``LOGIN_REQUIRED_URLS_EXCEPTIONS`` tidak lagi "
"didukung, termasuk padanannya dalam variabel lingkungan Docker."

msgid ""
":ref:`addon-weblate.webhook.webhook` secret length is now validated to match "
"the Standard Webhooks specification."
msgstr ""
"Panjang rahasia :ref:`addon-weblate.webhook.webhook` sekarang divalidasi "
"agar sesuai dengan spesifikasi Kait Web Standar."

msgid "Python 3.12 or newer is now required."
msgstr "Python 3.12 atau versi yang lebih baru sekarang diperlukan."

msgid "GLib 2.80 or newer is now required."
msgstr "GLib 2.80 atau versi yang lebih baru sekarang diperlukan."

msgid "Dropped support for Web Monetization."
msgstr "Menghentikan dukungan untuk Monetisasi Web."

msgid ""
":doc:`/formats/laravel` no longer includes ``return`` prefix in the keys."
msgstr ""
":doc:`/formats/laravel` tidak lagi menyertakan awalan ``return`` pada kunci."

msgid ""
"There are several changes in :file:`settings_example.py`, most notable are "
"changed settings ``CRISPY_ALLOWED_TEMPLATE_PACKS`` and ``INSTALLED_APPS``; "
"please adjust your settings accordingly."
msgstr ""
"Ada beberapa perubahan dalam :file:`settings_example.py`, yang paling "
"menonjol adalah perubahan pengaturan ``CRISPY_ALLOWED_TEMPLATE_PACKS`` dan "
"``INSTALLED_APPS``; silakan sesuaikan pengaturan Anda."

