"appearance of the generic OIDC authentication."
msgstr ""
":envvar:`WEBLATE_SOCIAL_AUTH_OIDC_TITLE` "
"dan :envvar:`WEBLATE_SOCIAL_AUTH_OIDC_IMAGE` memungkinkan konfigurasi "
"tampilan autentikasi OIDC umum."

