msgid "Integrating with Weblate"
msgstr "Integrasi dengan Weblate"

msgid "Importing a localization project into Weblate"
msgstr "Mengimpor proyek lokalisasi ke Weblate"

msgid ""
"Weblate has been developed with VCS integration in mind as it’s core "
"feature, so the easiest way is to grant Weblate the access to your "
"repository. The import process will guide you through configuring your "
"translations into Weblate components."
msgstr ""
"Weblate dikembangkan dengan mempertimbangkan integrasi VCS sebagai fitur "
"utamanya, jadi cara termudah adalah dengan memberikan Weblate akses ke "
"repositori Anda. Proses impor akan memandu Anda dalam mengkonfigurasikan "
"terjemahan Anda ke dalam komponen Weblate."

msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can let Weblate set up a local-only repository containing "
"all the translations without integration."
msgstr ""
"Alternatifnya, Anda dapat membiarkan Weblate menyiapkan hanya repositori "
"lokal yang berisi semua terjemahan tanpa integrasi."

msgid "Fetching updated translations from Weblate"
msgstr "Mengambil terjemahan yang diperbarui dari Weblate"

msgid ""
"Weblate stores updated strings in a database and commits them to a local "
"version-control repository. You can add a Weblate repository (when :ref:`git-"
"exporter` is turned on) as an additional remote repository and fetch "
"translation updates from it."
msgstr ""
"Weblate menyimpan string yang diperbarui dalam basis data dan mengirimkannya "
"ke repositori kontrol versi lokal. Anda dapat menambahkan repositori Weblate "
"(ketika :ref:`git-exporter` diaktifkan) sebagai repositori jarak jauh "
"tambahan dan mengambil pembaruan terjemahan darinya."

msgid ""
"Prior to this, you might want to commit any pending local changes made in "
"Weblate (see :ref:`lazy-commit`). This can be done from the user interface "
"(in the :guilabel:`Repository maintenance`), or from the command-line "
"using :ref:`wlc`."
msgstr ""
"Sebelum ini, Anda mungkin ingin melakukan komit terhadap perubahan lokal "
"yang tertunda yang dibuat di Weblate (lihat :ref:`lazy-commit`). Ini dapat "
"dilakukan dari antarmuka pengguna (di :guilabel:`Pemeliharaan repositori`), "
"atau dari baris perintah menggunakan :ref:`wlc`."

#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Pushing changes can be automated if you grant Weblate push access to your "
#| "repository and configure :ref:`component-push` in the :ref:`component`, "
#| "see :ref:`push-changes`."
msgid ""
"Pushing changes can be automated if you grant Weblate push access to your "
"repository and configure :ref:`component-push` in the :ref:`component`, "
"see :ref:`code-hosting-push-options`."
msgstr ""
"Mendorong perubahan dapat diotomatisasikan jika Anda memberikan akses push "
"Weblate ke repositori Anda dan mengkonfigurasikan :ref:`component-push` "
"di :ref:`component`, lihat :ref:`push-changes`."

msgid ""
"Alternatively, use :doc:`/api` to update translations so that they match the "
"latest version from the upstream in your remote VCS repository."
msgstr ""
"Atau, gunakan :doc:`/api` untuk memperbarui terjemahan agar sesuai dengan "
"versi terbaru dari hulu di repositori VCS jarak jauh Anda."

msgid "Fetching remote changes into Weblate"
msgstr "Mengambil perubahan jarak jauh ke Weblate"

msgid ""
"To fetch any strings recently updated in your remote VCS repository into "
"Weblate, allow Weblate to pull from the upstream repository. This can be "
"achieved in the user interface (in the :guilabel:`Repository maintenance`), "
"or from the command-line using :ref:`wlc`."
msgstr ""
"Untuk mengambil string apa pun yang baru saja diperbarui di repositori VCS "
"jarak jauh Anda ke Weblate, izinkan Weblate untuk mengambil dari repositori "
"hulu. Ini dapat dilakukan di antarmuka pengguna (di :guilabel:`Pemeliharaan "
"repositori`), atau dari baris perintah menggunakan :ref:`wlc`."

msgid ""
"This can be automated by setting a webhook in your repository to trigger "
"Weblate whenever there is a new commit. See :ref:`update-vcs` for more "
"details."
msgstr ""
"Hal ini dapat diotomatisasi dengan mengatur webhook di repositori Anda untuk "
"memicu Weblate jika ada komit baru. Lihat :ref:`update-vcs` untuk rincian "
"lebih lanjut."

msgid ""
"If not using VCS integration, you can use the UI or :doc:`/api` to update "
"the translations so that they match your codebase."
msgstr ""
"Jika tidak menggunakan integrasi VCS, Anda dapat menggunakan UI atau :doc:`/"
"api` untuk memperbarui terjemahan agar cocok dengan basis kode Anda."

#, fuzzy
