msgstr ""
"Nonaktifkan integrasi eksternal (Git/webhook) jika merupakan bagian dari "
"vektor serangan."

msgid "Suspend affected user accounts immediately."
msgstr "Segera tangguhkan akun pengguna yang terpengaruh."

msgid ""
"Revoke or rotate affected administrative, API, VCS, and webhook credentials "
