msgid "Recovery"
msgstr "Pemulihan"

msgid ""
"Restore affected services or data from the latest known-good Weblate backups."
msgstr ""
"Pulihkan layanan atau data yang terpengaruh dari cadangan Weblate terbaru "
"yang diketahui masih bagus."

msgid ""
"**PII Assessment:** DPO determines if the breach requires a 72-hour GDPR "
