msgid "Maximum length of translation"
msgstr "Panjang maksimum terjemahan"

msgid "Translation should not exceed given length."
msgstr "Terjemahan tidak boleh melebihi panjang yang diberikan."

msgid ""
"Checks that translations are of acceptable length to fit available space. "
"This only checks for the length of translation characters."
msgstr ""
"Memeriksa apakah terjemahan memiliki panjang yang dapat diterima agar sesuai "
"dengan ruang yang tersedia. Ini hanya memeriksa panjang karakter terjemahan."

msgid ""
"Unlike the other checks, the flag should be set as a ``key:value`` pair like "
"``max-length:100``."
msgstr ""
"Tidak seperti pemeriksaan lainnya, penanda harus diatur sebagai pasangan "
"``key:value`` seperti ``max-length:100``."

msgid ""
"The ``max-length`` flag also triggers :ref:`check-source-max-length` for "
"source strings. For English source strings, including English variants, this "
"check warns when the source uses more than 85% of the configured length to "
"leave room for translation expansion. For other source languages, the "
"configured ``max-length`` is used directly."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This check looks at number of chars, what might not be the best metric when "
"using proportional fonts to render the text. The :ref:`check-max-size` check "
"does check actual rendering of the text."
msgstr ""
"Pemeriksaan ini memeriksa jumlah karakter, yang mungkin bukan metrik terbaik "
"saat menggunakan huruf proporsional untuk merender teks. "
"Pemeriksaan :ref:`check-max-size` memeriksa rendering teks yang sebenarnya."

msgid ""
"The ``replacements:`` flag might be also useful to expand placeables before "
"checking the string."
msgstr ""
"Penanda ``replacements:`` mungkin juga berguna untuk memperluas penempatan "
"sebelum memeriksa string."

msgid ""
"When ``xml-text`` flag is also used, the length calculation ignores XML tags."
msgstr ""
"Ketika penanda ``xml-text`` juga digunakan, perhitungan panjang mengabaikan "
"tag XML."

msgid "Maximum number of lines"
msgstr "Jumlah baris maksimum"

msgid "Translation should not exceed given number of lines."
msgstr "Terjemahan tidak boleh melebihi jumlah baris yang diberikan."

msgid ""
"Checks that translations do not exceed the configured maximum number of "
"lines. This is useful for translations targeting fixed-height UI elements "
"such as displays, terminals, or constrained containers where a specific "
"number of visible lines is required."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Unlike the other checks, the flag should be set as a ``key:value`` pair "
#| "like ``max-length:100``."
msgid ""
"Unlike the other checks, the flag should be set as a ``key:value`` pair like "
"``max-lines:3``."
msgstr ""
"Tidak seperti pemeriksaan lainnya, penanda harus diatur sebagai pasangan "
"``key:value`` seperti ``max-length:100``."

msgid ""
"A translation with more lines than the configured value triggers a warning. "
"Lines are counted by the number of newline characters plus one."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This check counts display lines (separated by ``\\\\n``), not wrapped lines. "
"If your UI wraps text automatically, use :ref:`check-max-size` instead."
msgstr ""

msgid "Maximum size of translation"
msgstr "Ukuran maksimum terjemahan"

msgid "Rendered text should not exceed given size."
msgstr "Teks yang dirender tidak boleh melebihi ukuran yang diberikan."

#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Untranslated strings"
msgid "source and translated strings"
msgstr "String yang belum diterjemahkan"

#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Translation rendered text should not exceed given size. It renders the "
#| "text with line wrapping and checks if it fits into given boundaries."
msgid ""
"Rendered source or translation text should not exceed given size. It renders "
"the text and checks if it fits into given boundaries. Word wrapping is "
"applied when more than one line is configured."
msgstr ""
"Teks yang dirender terjemahan tidak boleh melebihi ukuran yang diberikan. "
"Teks akan dirender dengan pembungkusan baris dan diperiksa apakah sesuai "
"dengan batas yang diberikan."

msgid ""
"This check needs one or two parameters - maximal width and maximal number of "
"lines. In case the number of lines is not provided, one line text is "
"considered."
msgstr ""
"Pemeriksaan ini membutuhkan satu atau dua parameter - lebar maksimal dan "
"jumlah baris maksimal. Jika jumlah baris tidak ditentukan, teks satu baris "
"akan dipertimbangkan."

msgid ""
"You can also configure used font by ``font-*`` directives (see :ref:`custom-"
"checks`), for example following translation flags say that the text rendered "
"with ubuntu font size 22 should fit into two lines and 500 pixels:"
msgstr ""
"Anda juga dapat mengkonfigurasikan huruf yang digunakan dengan direktif "
"``font-*`` (lihat :ref:`custom-checks`), misalnya tanda terjemahan berikut "
"menyatakan bahwa teks yang ditampilkan dengan ukuran huruf Ubuntu 22 harus "
"muat dalam dua baris dan 500 piksel:"

msgid ""
"You might want to set ``font-*`` directives in :ref:`component` to have the "
"same font configured for all strings within a component. You can override "
"those values per string in case you need to customize it per string."
msgstr ""
"Anda mungkin ingin mengatur direktif ``font-*`` di :ref:`component` agar "
"font yang sama dikonfigurasi untuk semua string dalam suatu komponen. Anda "
"dapat menimpakan nilai tersebut per string jika Anda perlu menyesuaikannya "
"per string."

msgid "Mismatched \\\\n"
msgstr "\\\\n tidak cocok"

msgid "Number of \\\\n literals in translation does not match source."
msgstr "Jumlah literal \\\\n dalam terjemahan tidak sesuai dengan sumbernya."

msgid ""
"Usually escaped newlines are important for formatting program output. Check "
"fails if the number of ``\\n`` literals in translation does not match the "
"source."
msgstr ""
"Biasanya, baris baru yang lolos penting untuk memformat keluaran program. "
"Pemeriksaan gagal jika jumlah literal ``\\n`` dalam terjemahan tidak cocok "
"dengan sumbernya."

msgid "Mismatched colon"
msgstr "Tanda titik dua tidak cocok"

msgid "Source and translation do not both end with a colon."
msgstr "Sumber dan terjemahan tidak keduanya diakhiri dengan titik dua."

msgid ""
"Checks that colons are replicated between both source and translation. The "
"presence of colons is also checked for various languages where they do not "
"belong (Chinese or Japanese)."
msgstr ""
"Memeriksa replikasi titik dua antara sumber dan terjemahan. Keberadaan titik "
"dua juga diperiksa untuk berbagai bahasa yang tidak seharusnya (Mandarin "
"atau Jepang)."

msgid ""
"`Colon on Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Colon_(punctuation)>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Titik dua di Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Colon_(punctuation)>`_"

msgid "Mismatched ellipsis"
msgstr "Tanda elipsis tidak cocok"

msgid "Source and translation do not both end with an ellipsis."
msgstr "Sumber dan terjemahan tidak keduanya diakhiri dengan elipsis."

msgid ""
"Checks that trailing ellipses are replicated between both source and "
"translation. This only checks for real ellipsis (``…``) not for three dots "
"(``...``)."
msgstr ""
"Memeriksa replikasi elipsis di akhir teks antara sumber dan terjemahan. Ini "
"hanya memeriksa elipsis asli (``…``), bukan tiga titik (``...``)."

msgid ""
"An ellipsis is usually rendered nicer than three dots in print, and sounds "
"better with text-to-speech."
msgstr ""
"Elipsis biasanya ditampilkan lebih bagus daripada tiga titik saat dicetak, "
"dan terdengar lebih baik dengan teks-ke-ucapan."

msgid "`Ellipsis on Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ellipsis>`_"
msgstr "`Elipsis di Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ellipsis>`_"

msgid "Mismatched exclamation mark"
msgstr "Tanda seru tidak cocok"

msgid "Source and translation do not both end with an exclamation mark."
msgstr "Sumber dan terjemahan tidak keduanya diakhiri dengan tanda seru."

msgid ""
"Checks that exclamations are replicated between both source and translation. "
"The presence of exclamation marks is also checked for various languages "
"where they do not belong (Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Armenian, Limbu, "
"Myanmar or Nko)."
msgstr ""
"Memeriksa apakah tanda seru direplikasi antara sumber dan terjemahan. "
"Keberadaan tanda seru juga diperiksa untuk berbagai bahasa yang tidak "
"seharusnya (Mandarin, Jepang, Korea, Armenia, Limbu, Myanmar, atau Nko)."

msgid ""
"`Exclamation mark on Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Exclamation_mark>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Tanda seru di Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Exclamation_mark>`_"

msgid "Mismatched full stop"
msgstr "Tanda titik tidak cocok"

msgid "Source and translation do not both end with a full stop."
msgstr "Sumber dan terjemahan tidak keduanya diakhiri dengan tanda titik."

msgid ""
"Checks that full stops are replicated between both source and translation. "
"The presence of full stops is checked for various languages where they do "
"not belong (Chinese, Japanese, Devanagari or Urdu)."
msgstr ""
"Memeriksa pengulangan titik antara sumber dan terjemahan. Keberadaan titik "
"diperiksa untuk berbagai bahasa yang tidak seharusnya (Mandarin, Jepang, "
"Dewanagari, atau Urdu)."

msgid "`Full stop on Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Full_stop>`_"
msgstr "`Titik di Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Full_stop>`_"

msgid "Mismatched interrobang"
msgstr "Tanda interrobang tidak cocok"

msgid "Source and translation do not both end with an interrobang expression."
msgstr ""
"Sumber dan terjemahan tidak keduanya diakhiri dengan ekspresi interobang."

msgid ""
"Checks that interrobang marks are replicated between both source and "
"translation. It allows the swap between \"!?\" and \"?!\"."
msgstr ""
"Memeriksa apakah tanda interrobang direplikasi antara sumber dan terjemahan. "
"Hal ini memungkinkan pertukaran antara \"!?\" dan \"?!\"."

msgid ""
"`Interrobang mark on Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Interrobang>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Tanda Interrobang di Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Interrobang>`_"

msgid "Mismatched question mark"
msgstr "Tanda tanya tidak cocok"

msgid "Source and translation do not both end with a question mark."
msgstr "Sumber dan terjemahan tidak keduanya diakhiri dengan tanda tanya."

msgid ""
"Checks that question marks are replicated between both source and "
"translation. The presence of question marks is also checked for various "
"languages where they do not belong (Armenian, Arabic, Chinese, Korean, "
"Japanese, Ethiopic, Vai or Coptic)."
msgstr ""
"Memeriksa apakah tanda tanya direplikasi antara sumber dan terjemahan. "
"Keberadaan tanda tanya juga diperiksa untuk berbagai bahasa yang tidak "
"seharusnya (Armenia, Arab, Mandarin, Korea, Jepang, Etiopia, Vai, atau "
"Koptik)."

msgid ""
"`Question mark on Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Question_mark>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Tanda tanya di Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Question_mark>`_"

msgid "Mismatched semicolon"
msgstr "Tanda titik koma tidak cocok"

msgid "Source and translation do not both end with a semicolon."
msgstr "Sumber dan terjemahan tidak keduanya diakhiri dengan titik koma."

msgid ""
"Checks that semicolons at the end of sentences are replicated between both "
"source and translation."
msgstr ""
"Memeriksa apakah titik koma di akhir kalimat direplikasi antara sumber dan "
"terjemahan."

msgid "`Semicolon on Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Semicolon>`_"
msgstr "`Titik koma di Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Semicolon>`_"

msgid "Mismatching line breaks"
msgstr "Jeda baris tidak cocok"

msgid "Number of new lines in translation does not match source."
msgstr "Jumlah baris baru dalam terjemahan tidak cocok dengan sumber."

msgid ""
"Usually newlines are important for formatting program output. Check fails if "
"the number of new lines in translation does not match the source."
msgstr ""
"Biasanya, baris baru penting untuk memformat keluaran program. Pemeriksaan "
"gagal jika jumlah baris baru yang diterjemahkan tidak sesuai dengan "
"sumbernya."

msgid "Missing plurals"
msgstr "Jamak hilang"

msgid "Some plural forms are untranslated."
msgstr "Beberapa bentuk jamak belum diterjemahkan."

msgid ""
"Checks that all plural forms of a source string have been translated. "
"Specifics on how each plural form is used can be found in the string "
"definition."
msgstr ""
"Memeriksa apakah semua bentuk jamak dari string sumber telah diterjemahkan. "
"Rincian penggunaan setiap bentuk jamak dapat ditemukan dalam definisi string."

msgid ""
"Failing to fill in plural forms will in some cases lead to displaying "
"nothing when the plural form is in use."
msgstr ""
"Gagal mengisi formulir jamak dalam beberapa kasus akan menyebabkan tidak "
"ditampilkannya apa pun saat bentuk jamak digunakan."

msgid "Multiple capitals"
msgstr "Beberapa kapital"

msgid "Translation contains words with multiple misplaced capital letters."
msgstr "Terjemahan berisi kata dengan banyak huruf kapital yang salah tempat."

msgid ""
"Checks for misplaced capitalization by detecting words that contain "
"consecutive uppercase letters in otherwise lowercase or normally capitalized "
"text (for example, ``HEllo`` or ``CAmelCase``). Strings that contain "
"capitalization in the source string are allowed to contain capitalization in "
"the translation."
msgstr ""
"Memeriksa kesalahan penulisan huruf kapital dengan mendeteksi kata yang "
"berisi huruf kapital berurutan dalam teks yang seharusnya huruf kecil atau "
"huruf kapital biasa (misalnya, ``HEllo`` atau ``CAmelCase``). String yang "
"berisi huruf kapital dalam string sumber diperbolehkan untuk berisi huruf "
"kapital dalam terjemahan."

msgid "Non‑standard characters in Kabyle"
msgstr "Karakter non-standar dalam Kabyle"

msgid ""
"Use standardized Latin Kabyle characters (e.g. ɣ instead of Greek γ; ɛ "
"instead of ε)."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan karakter standar Kabyle Latin (mis. ɣ daripada γ Yunani; ɛ daripada "
"ε)."

msgid ""
"Checks that Kabyle translations use correct Kabyle letters and not similar "
"Greek ones, which were often used before Kabyle characters were standardized "
"in Unicode."
msgstr ""
"Memeriksa bahwa terjemahan Kabyle menggunakan huruf Kabyle yang benar dan "
"bukan huruf Yunani yang mirip, yang sering digunakan sebelum karakter Kabyle "
"distandarisasi dalam Unicode."

msgid "Placeholders"
msgstr "Pengganti"

msgid "You can use regular expression as placeholder."
msgstr "Anda dapat menggunakan ekspresi reguler sebagai pengganti."

msgid ""
"With the ``case-insensitive`` flag, the placeholders are not case-sensitive."
msgstr ""
"Dengan penanda ``case-insensitive``, pengganti tidak peka huruf kapital."

msgid "Translation is missing some placeholders."
msgstr "Terjemahan kehilangan beberapa pengganti."

msgid ""
"Translation is missing some placeholders. These are either extracted from "
"the translation file or defined manually using ``placeholders`` flag, more "
"can be separated with colon, strings with space can be quoted:"
msgstr ""
"Terjemahan kehilangan beberapa pengganti. Ini diekstrak dari berkas "
"terjemahan atau didefinisikan secara manual menggunakan penanda "
"``placeholder``, lainnya dapat dipisahkan dengan titik dua, dan string "
"dengan spasi dapat diberi tanda kutip:"

msgid ""
"In case you have some syntax for placeholders, you can use a regular "
"expression:"
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda memiliki beberapa sintaksis untuk pengganti, Anda dapat "
"menggunakan ekspresi reguler:"

msgid "You can also have case insensitive placeholders:"
msgstr "Anda juga dapat memiliki pengganti yang tidak peka huruf kapital:"

msgid "Prohibited initial character"
msgstr "Karakter awal terlarang"

msgid "The string starts with a prohibited character in CSV."
msgstr "String diawali dengan karakter terlarang dalam CSV."

msgid "glossary strings"
msgstr "string glosarium"

msgid ""
"The glossary is often shared as CSV and using some characters at the "
"beginning is restricted by many applications as these can cause the text "
"being evaluated as an expression. This also affects :ref:`glossary-mt` where "
"many services use CSV for synchronizing glossaries and reject such strings."
msgstr ""
"Glosarium sering dibagikan sebagai CSV dan penggunaan beberapa karakter di "
"awal dibatasi oleh banyak aplikasi karena dapat menyebabkan teks yang "
"dievaluasi dianggap sebagai ekspresi. Hal ini juga "
"memengaruhi :ref:`glossary-mt` di mana banyak layanan menggunakan CSV untuk "
"menyinkronkan glosarium dan menolak string tersebut."

msgid "Punctuation spacing"
msgstr "Spasi tanda baca"

msgid ""
"This check used to apply to Breton language as well, but it was limited to "
"French only."
msgstr ""
"Pemeriksaan ini juga dulunya berlaku untuk Breton, tetapi terbatas hanya "
"pada Prancis."

msgid "Missing non breakable space before double punctuation sign."
msgstr "Tidak ada spasi yang dapat diputuskan sebelum tanda baca ganda."

msgid ""
"Checks that there is non breakable space before double punctuation sign "
"(exclamation mark, question mark, semicolon and colon). This rule is used "
"only in a few selected languages like French, where space before double "
"punctuation sign is a typographic rule."
msgstr ""
"Memeriksa adanya spasi yang tidak dapat dipisahkan sebelum tanda baca ganda "
"(tanda seru, tanda tanya, titik koma, dan titik dua). Aturan ini hanya "
"digunakan dalam beberapa bahasa tertentu seperti Prancis, di mana spasi "
"sebelum tanda baca ganda merupakan aturan tipografi."

msgid ""
"`French and English spacing on Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"History_of_sentence_spacing#French_and_English_spacing>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Jarak antara Prancis dan Inggris di Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/History_of_sentence_spacing#French_and_English_spacing>`_"

msgid ""
"Extended support for advanced regular expressions including Unicode "
"codepoint properties."
msgstr ""
"Dukungan yang diperluas untuk ekspresi reguler tingkat lanjut termasuk "
"properti titik kode Unicode."

msgid "Translation does not match regular expression."
msgstr "Terjemahan tidak cocok dengan ekspresi reguler."

msgid ""
"Translation does not match regular expression. The expression is either "
"extracted from the translation file or defined manually using ``regex`` flag:"
msgstr ""
"Terjemahan tidak sesuai dengan ekspresi reguler. Ekspresi tersebut diekstrak "
"dari berkas terjemahan atau didefinisikan secara manual menggunakan tanda "
"``regex``:"

msgid ""
"The matching also supports Unicode codepoint properties, including scripts "
"and blocks:"
msgstr ""
"Pencocokan juga mendukung properti titik kode Unicode, termasuk skrip dan "
"blok:"

msgid ""
"Use :ref:`check-placeholders` for detecting missing placeholders in the "
"string."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan :ref:`check-placeholders` untuk mendeteksi pengganti yang hilang "
"dalam string."

msgid "`regex documentation <https://github.com/mrabarnett/mrab-regex>`_"
msgstr "`Dokumentasi regex <https://github.com/mrabarnett/mrab-regex>`_"

msgid "reStructuredText syntax error"
msgstr "Galat sintaksis reStructuredText"

msgid "reStructuredText syntax error in the translation."
msgstr "Galat sintaksis reStructuredText dalam terjemahan."

msgid "reStructuredText syntax error in the translation. Issues to look for:"
msgstr ""
"Galat sintaks reStructuredText dalam terjemahan. Isu yang perlu diperhatikan:"

msgid "Mismatched closing/opening tags."
msgstr "Tag penutup/pembuka tidak cocok."

msgid "Reused translation"
msgstr "Terjemahan yang digunakan ulang"

msgid "Different strings are translated the same."
msgstr "String yang berbeda diterjemahkan secara sama."

msgid ""
"Check that fails if the same translation is used on different source "
"strings. Such translations can be intentional, but can also confuse users."
msgstr ""
"Pemeriksaan yang gagal jika terjemahan yang sama digunakan pada string "
"sumber yang berbeda. Terjemahan semacam itu bisa saja disengaja, tetapi juga "
"dapat membingungkan pengguna."

msgid "Safe MDX"
msgstr "MDX Aman"

msgid "JSX expressions in the translation do not match the source."
msgstr "Ekspresi JSX dalam terjemahan tidak cocok dengan sumber."

msgid "Same plurals"
msgstr "Jamak yang sama"

msgid "Some plural forms are translated in the same way."
msgstr "Beberapa bentuk jamak diterjemahkan dengan cara yang sama."

msgid ""
"Check that fails if some plural forms are duplicated in the translation. In "
"most languages they have to be different."
msgstr ""
"Pemeriksaan yang gagal jika beberapa bentuk jamak terganda dalam terjemahan. "
"Dalam kebanyakan bahasa, bentuk tersebut harus berbeda."

msgid "Starting newline"
msgstr "Mulai baris baru"

msgid "Source and translation do not both start with a newline."
msgstr "Sumber dan terjemahan tidak keduanya dimulai dengan baris baru."

msgid ""
"Newlines usually appear in source strings for good reason, omissions or "
"additions can lead to formatting problems when the translated text is put to "
"use."
msgstr ""
"Baris baru biasanya muncul dalam string sumber karena alasan yang baik, "
"penghilangan atau penambahan dapat menyebabkan masalah pemformatan saat teks "
"terjemahan digunakan."

msgid "Starting spaces"
msgstr "Spasi di awal"

msgid "Source and translation do not both start with same number of spaces."
msgstr ""
"Sumber dan terjemahan tidak keduanya dimulai dengan jumlah spasi yang sama."

msgid ""
"A space in the beginning of a string is usually used for indentation in the "
"interface and thus important to keep."
msgstr ""
"Spasi di awal string biasanya digunakan untuk indentasi dalam antarmuka dan "
"karenanya penting untuk dipertahankan."

msgid "Trailing newline"
msgstr "Baris baru di belakang"

msgid "Source and translation do not both end with a newline."
msgstr "Sumber dan terjemahan tidak keduanya diakhiri dengan baris baru."

msgid "Trailing space"
msgstr "Spasi di belakang"

msgid "Source and translation do not both end with a space."
msgstr "Sumber dan terjemahan tidak keduanya diakhiri dengan spasi."

msgid ""
"Checks that trailing spaces are replicated between both source and "
"translation."
msgstr ""
"Memeriksa apakah spasi di akhir direplikasi antara sumber dan terjemahan."

msgid ""
"Trailing space is usually utilized to space out neighbouring elements, so "
"removing it might break layout."
msgstr ""
"Spasi tambahan biasanya digunakan untuk memberi jarak pada elemen yang "
"berdekatan, jadi menghilangkannya dapat merusak tata letak."

msgid "Unchanged translation"
msgstr "Terjemahan tidak berubah"

msgid "Source and translation are identical."
msgstr "Sumber dan terjemahan identik."

msgid ""
"Happens if the source and corresponding translation strings are identical, "
"down to at least one of the plural forms. Some strings commonly found across "
"all languages are ignored, and various markups are stripped. This reduces "
"the number of false positives."
msgstr ""
"Terjadi jika string sumber dan terjemahan yang sesuai identik, hingga "
"setidaknya satu bentuk jamak. Beberapa string yang umum ditemukan di semua "
"bahasa diabaikan, dan berbagai markah dihilangkan. Ini mengurangi jumlah "
"positif palsu."

msgid "This check can help find strings mistakenly untranslated."
msgstr ""
"Pemeriksaan ini dapat membantu menemukan string yang salah diterjemahkan."

msgid ""
"The default behavior of this check is to exclude words from the built-in "
"terms list from the checking. These are words which are frequently not being "
"translated. This is useful to avoid false positives on short strings, which "
"consist only of a single word which is the same in several languages. This "
"list can be disabled by adding ``strict-same`` flag to a string or component."
msgstr ""
"Perilaku bawaan pemeriksaan ini adalah mengecualikan kata dari daftar "
"istilah bawaan dari pemeriksaan. Ini seringkali tidak diterjemahkan. Hal ini "
"berguna untuk menghindari positif palsu pada string pendek, yang hanya "
"terdiri dari satu kata yang sama dalam beberapa bahasa. Daftar ini dapat "
"dinonaktifkan dengan menambahkan penanda ``strict-same`` ke string atau "
"komponen."

msgid ""
"With ``check-glossary`` flag (see :ref:`check-check-glossary`), the "
"untranslatable glossary terms are excluded from the checking."
msgstr ""
"Dengan penanda ``check-glossary`` (lihat :ref:`check-check-glossary`), "
"istilah glosarium yang tidak dapat diterjemahkan dikecualikan dari "
"pemeriksaan."

msgid "Unsafe HTML"
msgstr "HTML Tidak Aman"

msgid "The translation uses unsafe HTML markup."
msgstr "Terjemahan menggunakan markah HTML yang tidak aman."

#, fuzzy
#| msgid ":ref:`html`, :ref:`markdown`, :ref:`asciidoc`"
msgid ":ref:`html`, :ref:`markdown`, :ref:`mdx`, :ref:`asciidoc`"
msgstr ":ref:`html`, :ref:`markdown`, :ref:`asciidoc`"

msgid "``auto-safe-html``, ``safe-html``"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"``auto-safe-html``: Treat a text as conditional HTML, enabling :ref:`check-"
"safe-html` only for plain text or source strings that contain standard HTML "
"markup or valid custom elements. This is useful for extended Markdown "
"variants such as MDX, where angle-bracket syntax may not be HTML."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The translation uses unsafe HTML markup. This check has to be enabled using "
"``safe-html`` flag (see :ref:`custom-checks`). There is also accompanied "
"autofixer which can automatically sanitize the markup."
msgstr ""
"Terjemahan menggunakan markah HTML yang tidak aman. Pemeriksaan ini harus "
"diaktifkan menggunakan tanda ``safe-html`` (lihat :ref:`custom-checks`). "
"Tersedia juga perbaikan otomatis yang dapat membersihkan markah secara "
"otomatis."

msgid ""
"When ``md-text`` flag is also used, the Markdown style links are also "
"allowed."
msgstr ""
"Bila penanda ``md-text`` juga digunakan, tautan bergaya Markdown juga "
"diperbolehkan."

msgid ""
"The HTML check is performed by the `Ammonia <https://github.com/rust-ammonia/"
"ammonia>`_ library."
msgstr ""
"Pemeriksaan HTML dilakukan oleh pustaka `Ammonia <https://github.com/rust-"
"ammonia/ammonia>`_."

msgid "URL"
msgstr "URL"

msgid "The translation does not contain a URL."
msgstr "Terjemahan tidak berisi URL."

#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The translation does not contain an URL. This is triggered only in case "
#| "the unit is marked as containing URL. In that case the translation has to "
#| "be a valid URL."
msgid ""
"The translation does not contain a URL. This is triggered only in case the "
"unit is marked as containing URL. In that case the translation has to be a "
"valid URL."
msgstr ""
"Terjemahan tidak berisi URL. Ini hanya dipicu jika unit ditandai berisi URL. "
"Dalam hal ini, terjemahan harus berupa URL yang valid."

msgid "XML markup"
msgstr "Markah XML"

msgid "XML tags in translation do not match source."
msgstr "Tag XML dalam terjemahan tidak cocok dengan sumber."

msgid ""
"This usually means the resulting output will look different. In most cases "
"this is not a desired result from changing the translation, but occasionally "
"it is."
msgstr ""
"Ini biasanya berarti hasil keluaran akan terlihat berbeda. Dalam kebanyakan "
"kasus, ini bukanlah hasil yang diinginkan dari perubahan terjemahan, tetapi "
"terkadang memang demikian."

msgid ""
"Checks that XML tags are replicated between both source and translation."
msgstr "Memeriksa apakah tag XML direplikasi antara sumber dan terjemahan."

msgid ""
"The check is automatically enabled for XML like strings. You might need to "
"add ``xml-text`` flag in some cases to force turning it on."
msgstr ""
"Pemeriksaan ini diaktifkan secara otomatis untuk string seperti XML. Anda "
"mungkin perlu menambahkan penanda ``xml-text`` dalam beberapa kasus untuk "
"mengaktifkannya secara paksa."

msgid "XML syntax"
msgstr "Sintaksis XML"

msgid "The translation is not valid XML."
msgstr "Terjemahan bukan XML yang valid."

msgid "The XML markup is not valid."
msgstr "Markah XML tidak valid."

msgid "Zero-width space"
msgstr "Spasi lebar nol"

msgid "Translation contains extra zero-width space character."
msgstr "Terjemahan berisi karakter spasi tanpa lebar ekstra."

msgid ""
"Zero-width space (<U+200B>) characters are used to break messages within "
"words (word wrapping)."
msgstr ""
"Karakter spasi nol (<U+200B>) digunakan untuk memecah pesan di dalam kata "
"(pembungkusan kata)."

msgid ""
"As they are usually inserted by mistake, this check is triggered once they "
"are present in translation. Some programs might have problems when this "
"character is used."
msgstr ""
"Karena karakter ini biasanya dimasukkan secara tidak sengaja, pemeriksaan "
"ini dipicu setelah karakter tersebut muncul dalam proses terjemahan. "
"Beberapa program mungkin mengalami masalah saat karakter ini digunakan."

msgid ""
"`Zero width space on Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zero-"
"width_space>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Spasi lebar nol di Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zero-"
"width_space>`_"

msgid "Source checks"
msgstr "Pemeriksaan sumber"

msgid ""
"Source checks can help developers improve the quality of source strings."
msgstr ""
"Pemeriksaan sumber dapat membantu pengembang meningkatkan kualitas string "
"sumber."

msgid "Ellipsis"
msgstr "Elipsis"

msgid ""
"The string uses three dots ``(...)`` instead of an ellipsis character "
"``(…)``."
msgstr ""
"String menggunakan tiga titik ``(...)`` alih-alih karakter elipsis ``(…)``."

msgid "source strings"
msgstr "string sumber"

msgid ""
"This fails when the string uses three dots (``...``) when it should use an "
"ellipsis character (``…``)."
msgstr ""
"Ini gagal saat string menggunakan tiga titik (``...``) padahal seharusnya "
"menggunakan karakter elipsis (``…``)."

msgid ""
"Using the Unicode character is in most cases the better approach and looks "
"better rendered, and may sound better with text-to-speech."
msgstr ""
"Menggunakan karakter Unicode dalam kebanyakan kasus merupakan pendekatan "
"yang lebih baik dan terlihat lebih baik jika ditampilkan, dan mungkin "
"terdengar lebih baik dengan text-to-speech."

msgid "Fluent source inner HTML"
msgstr "HTML dalam sumber Fluent"

msgid "Fluent source should be valid inner HTML."
msgstr "Sumber Fluent harus berupa HTML dalam yang valid."

msgid ""
"Fluent is often used in contexts where the value for a Message (or Term) is "
"meant to be used directly as ``.innerHTML`` (rather than ``.textContent``) "
"for some HTML element. For example, when using the Fluent DOM package."
msgstr ""
"Fluent sering digunakan dalam konteks di mana nilai untuk sebuah Pesan (atau "
"Istilah) dimaksudkan untuk digunakan langsung sebagai ``.innerHTML`` (alih-"
"alih ``.textContent``) untuk beberapa elemen HTML. Misalnya, saat "
"menggunakan paket DOM Fluent."

#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The aim of this check is to predict how the value will be parsed as inner "
#| "HTML, assuming a HTML5 conforming parser, to catch cases where there "
#| "would be some \"unintended\" loss of the string, without being too strict "
#| "about technical parsing errors that do *not* lead to a loss of the string."
msgid ""
"The aim of this check is to predict how the value will be parsed as inner "
"HTML, assuming an HTML5 conforming parser, to catch cases where there would "
"be some \"unintended\" loss of the string, without being too strict about "
"technical parsing errors that do *not* lead to a loss of the string."
msgstr ""
"Tujuan pemeriksaan ini adalah untuk memprediksi bagaimana nilai akan diurai "
"sebagai HTML bagian dalam, dengan asumsi parser yang sesuai dengan HTML5, "
"untuk menangkap kasus yang mungkin mengalami kehilangan string yang \"tidak "
"disengaja\", tanpa terlalu ketat mengenai galat penguraian teknis yang "
"*tidak* menyebabkan hilangnya string."

msgid ""
"This check is applied to the value of Fluent Messages or Terms, but not "
"their Attributes. For Messages, the Fluent Attributes are often just HTML "
"attribute values, so can be arbitrary strings. For Terms, the Fluent "
"Attributes are often language properties that can only be referenced in the "
"selectors of Fluent Select Expressions."
msgstr ""
"Pemeriksaan ini diterapkan pada nilai Pesan atau Istilah Fluent, tetapi "
"tidak pada Atributnya. Untuk Pesan, Atribut Fluent seringkali hanya berupa "
"nilai atribut HTML, sehingga dapat berupa string sembarangan. Untuk Istilah, "
"Atribut Fluent seringkali berupa properti bahasa yang hanya dapat "
"direferensikan dalam selektor Ekspresi Select Fluent."

#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Generally, most Fluent values are not expected to contain any HTML "
#| "markup. Therefore, this check does not expect or want translators and "
#| "developers to have to care about strictly avoiding *any* technical HTML5 "
#| "parsing errors (let alone XHTML parsing errors). Instead, this check will "
#| "just want to warn them when they may have unintentionally opened a HTML "
#| "tag or inserted a character reference."
msgid ""
"Generally, most Fluent values are not expected to contain any HTML markup. "
"Therefore, this check does not expect or want translators and developers to "
"have to care about strictly avoiding *any* technical HTML5 parsing errors "
"(let alone XHTML parsing errors). Instead, this check will just want to warn "
"them when they may have unintentionally opened an HTML tag or inserted a "
"character reference."
msgstr ""
"Umumnya, sebagian besar nilai Fluent tidak diharapkan berisi markah HTML apa "
"pun. Oleh karena itu, pemeriksaan ini tidak mengharuskan penerjemah dan "
"pengembang untuk benar-benar menghindari *segala* galat penguraian HTML5 "
"teknis (apalagi galat penguraian XHTML). Sebaliknya, pemeriksaan ini hanya "
"ingin memperingatkan mereka ketika mereka mungkin secara tidak sengaja "
"membuka tag HTML atau memasukkan referensi karakter."

msgid ""
"Moreover, for the Fluent values that intentionally contain HTML tags or "
"character references, this check will verify some \"good practices\", such "
"as matching closing and ending tags, valid character references, and quoted "
"attribute values. In addition, whilst the HTML5 specification technically "
"allows for quite arbitrary tag and attribute names, this check will restrain "
"them to some basic ASCII values that should cover the standard HTML5 element "
"tags and attributes, as well as allow *some* custom element or attribute "
"names. This is partially to ensure that the user is using HTML intentionally."
msgstr ""
"Selain itu, untuk nilai Fluent yang sengaja berisi tag HTML atau referensi "
"karakter, pemeriksaan ini akan memverifikasi beberapa \"praktik baik\", "
"seperti pencocokan tag penutup dan penyelesaian, referensi karakter yang "
"valid, dan nilai atribut yang dikutip. Selain itu, meskipun spesifikasi "
"HTML5 secara teknis memperbolehkan penamaan tag dan atribut yang cukup "
"arbitrer, pemeriksaan ini akan membatasinya pada beberapa nilai ASCII dasar "
"yang seharusnya mencakup tag dan atribut elemen HTML5 standar, serta "
"memperbolehkan *beberapa* nama elemen atau atribut kustom. Hal ini sebagian "
"untuk memastikan bahwa pengguna menggunakan HTML secara sengaja."

msgid "Fluent inner HTML examples"
msgstr "Contoh HTML internal Fluent"

msgid "Warns?"
msgstr "Peringatan?"

msgid "Reason"
msgstr "Alasan"

msgid "yes"
msgstr "ya"

msgid "The ``<four`` part would be lost as ``.innerHTML``."
