msgid "Non-translatable terms"
msgstr "String belum diterjemahkan"

msgid ""
"Mark terms as :ref:`glossary-untranslatable` when they should stay "
"unchanged. Add :ref:`glossary-terminology` only when the term should be "
"present in every glossary language for matching and review."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Add the misleading translation as a :ref:`glossary-forbidden` entry. Add the "
"preferred wording as a separate regular glossary entry when translators "
"should use a specific translation instead."
msgstr ""

msgid "Glossaries in automatic suggestion"
msgstr "Glosarium dalam saran otomatis"

msgid ""
"Some automatic suggestion services utilize glossaries during the "
"translation, please consult their documentation in :doc:`/admin/machine` to "
"see the support."
msgstr ""
"Beberapa layanan saran otomatis menggunakan glosarium selama terjemahan, "
"silakan lihat dokumentasinya di :doc:`/admin/machine` untuk melihat "
"dukungannya."

msgid "The glossary is processed before exposed to the service:"
msgstr "Glosarium diproses sebelum diekspos ke layanan:"

msgid ""
"Duplicate source entries are skipped for services that require unique source "
"terms. LLM-based services can receive duplicates with explanations to "
"disambiguate them."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Any control characters and leading and trailing whitespace are stripped."
msgstr "Semua karakter kontrol dan spasi di awal dan di akhir dihapus."

msgid ":ref:`glossary-forbidden` are skipped."
msgstr ":ref:`glossary-forbidden` dilewati."

msgid ""
"Many services store glossaries server-side and enforce limit on the number "
"of saved glossaries. Weblate always deletes the oldest glossary if it runs "
"out of space."
msgstr ""
"Banyak layanan menyimpan glosarium di sisi server dan memaksakan batasan "
"jumlah glosarium yang disimpan. Weblate selalu menghapus glosarium terlama "
"jika kehabisan ruang."

msgid "Registration and user profile"
msgstr "Registrasi dan profil pengguna"

msgid ""
"Everybody can browse projects, view translations or suggest translations by "
"default. Only registered users are allowed to actually save changes, and are "
"credited for every translation made."
msgstr ""
"Semua orang dapat menelusuri proyek, melihat terjemahan, atau menyarankan "
"terjemahan secara bawaan. Hanya pengguna terdaftar yang diizinkan untuk "
"menyimpan perubahan, dan mendapatkan kredit untuk setiap terjemahan yang "
"dibuat."

msgid "You can register by following a few simple steps:"
msgstr "Anda dapat mendaftarkan dengan mengikuti beberapa langkah sederhana:"

msgid "Fill out the registration form with your credentials."
msgstr "Isi formulir pendaftaran dengan kredensial Anda."

msgid "Activate registration by following the link in the e-mail you receive."
msgstr ""
"Aktifkan pendaftaran dengan mengikuti tautan di surel yang Anda terima."

msgid "Optionally adjust your profile to choose which languages you know."
msgstr ""
"Secara opsional, sesuaikan profil Anda untuk memilih bahasa yang Anda "
"ketahui."

msgid "Dashboard"
msgstr "Dasbor"

msgid ""
"When you sign in, you will see an overview of projects and components, as "
"well as their respective translation progression."
msgstr ""
"Saat Anda masuk, Anda akan melihat ikhtisar proyek dan komponen, serta "
"perkembangan terjemahannya masing-masing."

msgid ""
"Components of projects you are watching are shown by default, and cross-"
"referenced with your preferred languages."
msgstr ""
"Komponen proyek yang Anda awasi ditampilkan secara bawaan, dan dirujuk "
"silang dengan bahasa pilihan Anda."

msgid "You can switch to different views using the navigation tabs."
msgstr "Anda dapat beralih ke tampilan berbeda menggunakan tab navigasi."

msgid "The menu has these options:"
msgstr "Menu memiliki opsi berikut:"

msgid ""
":guilabel:`Projects` > :guilabel:`Browse all projects` in the main menu "
"showing translation status for each project on the Weblate instance."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Proyek` > :guilabel:`Telusuri semua proyek` di menu utama yang "
"menampilkan status terjemahan untuk setiap proyek pada instansi Weblate."

msgid ""
"Selecting a language in the main menu :guilabel:`Languages` will show "
"translation status of all projects, filtered by one of your primary "
"languages."
msgstr ""
"Memilih bahasa di menu utama :guilabel:`Bahasa` akan menampilkan status "
"terjemahan semua proyek, difilter berdasarkan salah satu bahasa utama Anda."

msgid ""
":guilabel:`Watched translations` in the Dashboard will show translation "
"status of only those projects you are watching, filtered by your primary "
"languages."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Terjemahan yang dipantau` di Dasbor akan menampilkan status "
"terjemahan hanya dari proyek yang sedang Anda pantau, difilter menurut "
"bahasa utama Anda."

msgid ""
"In addition, the drop-down can also show any number of *component lists*, "
"sets of project components preconfigured by the Weblate administrator, "
"see :ref:`componentlists`."
msgstr ""
"Selain itu, menu tarik turun juga dapat menampilkan sejumlah *daftar "
"komponen*, kumpulan komponen proyek yang dikonfigurasikan sebelumnya oleh "
"administrator Weblate, lihat :ref:`componentlists`."

msgid ""
"You can configure your personal default dashboard view in "
"the :guilabel:`Preferences` section of your user profile settings."
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat mengkonfigurasikan tampilan dasbor bawaan pribadi Anda di "
"bagian :guilabel:`Preferensi` pada pengaturan profil pengguna Anda."

msgid ""
"When Weblate is configured for a single project "
"using :setting:`SINGLE_PROJECT` in the :file:`settings.py` file "
"(see :ref:`config`), the dashboard will not be shown, as the user will be "
"redirected to a single project or component instead."
msgstr ""
"Bila Weblate dikonfigurasikan untuk satu proyek "
"menggunakan :setting:`SINGLE_PROJECT` dalam berkas :file:`settings.py` "
"(lihat :ref:`config`), dasbor tidak akan ditampilkan, karena pengguna akan "
"diarahkan ke satu proyek atau komponen saja."

msgid ""
"The user profile is accessible by clicking your user icon in the top-right "
"of the top menu, then the :guilabel:`Settings` menu."
msgstr ""
"Profil pengguna dapat diakses dengan mengklik ikon pengguna Anda di kanan "
"atas menu atas, lalu menu :guilabel:`Pengaturan`."

#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The user profile contains your preferences. Name and e-mail address is "
#| "used in VCS commits, so keep this info accurate."
msgid ""
"The user profile contains your preferences. Name and e-mail address are used "
"in VCS commits, so keep this info accurate."
msgstr ""
"Profil pengguna berisi preferensi Anda. Nama dan alamat surel digunakan "
"dalam komit VCS, jadi pastikan informasi ini akurat."

msgid "All language selections only offer currently translated languages."
msgstr ""
"Semua pilihan bahasa hanya menawarkan bahasa yang saat ini diterjemahkan."

msgid ""
"Request or add other languages you want to translate by clicking the button "
"to make them available too."
msgstr ""
"Minta atau tambahkan bahasa lain yang ingin Anda terjemahkan dengan mengklik "
"tombol untuk menyediakannya juga."

msgid "Interface language"
msgstr "Bahasa antarmuka"

msgid "Choose the language you want to display the UI in."
msgstr "Pilih bahasa yang Anda inginkan untuk ditampilkan di antarmuka."

msgid "Translated languages"
msgstr "Bahasa yang diterjemahkan"

msgid ""
"Choose which languages you prefer to translate, and they will be offered on "
"the main page of watched projects, so that you have easier access to all "
"these translations in each of those languages."
msgstr ""
"Pilih bahasa mana yang Anda pilih untuk diterjemahkan, dan terjemahan "
"tersebut akan ditawarkan di halaman utama proyek yang dipantau, sehingga "
"Anda lebih mudah mengakses semua terjemahan dalam setiap bahasa tersebut."

msgid "Secondary languages"
msgstr "Bahasa sekunder"

msgid ""
"You can define which secondary languages are shown to you as a guide while "
"translating. An example can be seen in the following image, where the Hebrew "
"language is shown as secondarily:"
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat menentukan bahasa kedua mana yang ditampilkan sebagai panduan "
"saat menerjemahkan. Contohnya dapat dilihat pada gambar berikut, di mana "
"bahasa Ibrani ditampilkan sebagai bahasa kedua:"

msgid ""
"This can be also configured in the project (:ref:`project-"
"secondary_language`) or component (:ref:`component-secondary_language`). In "
"that case it can be used for :ref:`secondary-language-workflow`."
msgstr ""
"Ini juga dapat dikonfigurasi dalam proyek (:ref:`project-"
"secondary_language`) atau komponen (:ref:`component-secondary_language`). "
"Dalam hal ini, ini dapat digunakan untuk :ref:`secondary-language-workflow`."

msgid "Preferences"
msgstr "Preferensi"

msgid "Theme"
msgstr "Tema"

msgid ""
"Choose whether Weblate follows system settings for dark or light theme, or "
"choose one of them manually."
msgstr ""
"Pilih apakah Weblate mengikuti pengaturan sistem untuk tema gelap atau "
"terang, atau pilih salah satunya secara manual."

msgid "Table columns"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"By default, Weblate hides some columns in listings (languages, components, "
"projects, …) when the browser window is too narrow to fit them. "
"Enable :guilabel:`Show all columns in lists using horizontal scrolling` to "
"keep all columns instead and scroll the table horizontally when needed."
msgstr ""

msgid "Default dashboard view"
msgstr "Tampilan dasbor bawaan"

msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Preferences` tab, you can pick which of the available "
"dashboard views to present by default. If you pick the :guilabel:`Component "
"list`, you have to select which component list will be displayed from "
"the :guilabel:`Default component list` drop-down."
msgstr ""
"Pada tab :guilabel:`Preferensi`, Anda dapat memilih tampilan dasbor mana "
"yang akan ditampilkan secara bawaan. Jika Anda memilih :guilabel:`Daftar "
"komponen` Anda harus memilih daftar komponen mana yang akan ditampilkan dari "
"menu tarik turun :guilabel:`Daftar komponen bawaan`."

msgid "Editor link"
msgstr "Tautan penyuntingan"

msgid ""
"A source code link is shown in the web-browser configured in "
"the :ref:`component` by default."
msgstr ""
"Tautan kode sumber ditampilkan di peramban web yang dikonfigurasikan "
"dalam :ref:`component` secara bawaan."

msgid ""
"By setting the :guilabel:`Editor link`, you use your local editor to open "
"the VCS source code file of translated strings. You can use :ref:`markup`."
msgstr ""
"Dengan mengatur :guilabel:`Tautan penyunting`, Anda menggunakan penyunting "
"lokal untuk membuka berkas kode sumber VCS berisi string yang diterjemahkan. "
"Anda dapat menggunakan :ref:`markup`."

msgid ""
"Usually something like ``editor://open/?file={{filename}}&line={{line}}`` is "
"a good option."
msgstr ""
"Biasanya sesuatu seperti ``editor://open/?file={{filename}}&line={{line}}`` "
"adalah pilihan yang bagus."

msgid ""
"You can find more info on registering custom URL protocols for the editor in "
"the `Nette documentation <https://tracy.nette.org/en/open-files-in-ide>`_."
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat menemukan info lebih lanjut tentang mendaftarkan protokol URL "
"khusus untuk penyunting dalam `dokumentasi Nette <https://tracy.nette.org/en/"
"open-files-in-ide>`_."

msgid "Special characters"
msgstr "Karakter spesial"

msgid "Additional special characters to include in the :ref:`visual-keyboard`."
msgstr ""
"Karakter spesial tambahan untuk disertakan dalam :ref:`visual-keyboard`."

msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "Notifikasi"

msgid ""
"Subscribe to various notifications from the :guilabel:`Notifications` tab. "
"Notifications for selected events on watched or administered projects will "
"be sent to you per e-mail."
msgstr ""
"Berlangganan berbagai notifikasi dari tab :guilabel:`Notifikasi`. Notifikasi "
"untuk acara tertentu pada proyek yang dipantau atau dikelola akan dikirimkan "
"kepada Anda melalui surel."

msgid ""
"Some of the notifications are sent only for events in your languages (for "
"example about new strings to translate), while some trigger at component "
"level (for example merge errors). These two groups of notifications are "
"visually separated in the settings."
msgstr ""
"Beberapa notifikasi hanya dikirim untuk peristiwa dalam bahasa Anda "
"(misalnya tentang string baru yang akan diterjemahkan), sementara beberapa "
"notifikasi dipicu di tingkat komponen (misalnya galat penggabungan). Kedua "
"grup notifikasi ini dipisahkan secara visual di pengaturan."

msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Translation activity summary` notification is digest-only and "
"summarizes added, updated, translated, approved, needs editing, and "
"unfinished strings."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can toggle notifications for watched projects and administered projects "
"and it can be further tweaked (or muted) per project and component. Visit "
"the component overview page and select appropriate choice from "
"the :guilabel:`Watching` menu."
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat mengubah notifikasi untuk proyek yang dipantau dan proyek yang "
"dikelola, dan dapat disesuaikan (atau dibisukan) lebih lanjut per proyek dan "
"komponen. Kunjungi halaman ikhtisar komponen dan pilih opsi yang sesuai dari "
"menu :guilabel:`Memantau`."

#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "In case :guilabel:`Automatically watch projects on contribution` is "
#| "enabled you will automatically start watching projects upon translating a "
#| "string. The default value depends on :setting:`DEFAULT_AUTO_WATCH`."
msgid ""
"In case :guilabel:`Automatically watch projects on contribution` is enabled "
"you will automatically start watching projects upon contributing to them. "
"The default value depends on :setting:`DEFAULT_AUTO_WATCH`."
msgstr ""
"Jika :guilabel:`Pantau proyek dalam kontribusi secara otomatis` diaktifkan, "
"Anda akan otomatis mulai memantau proyek setelah menerjemahkan string. Nilai "
"bawaan bergantung pada :setting:`DEFAULT_AUTO_WATCH`."

msgid "You will not receive notifications for your own actions."
msgstr "Anda tidak akan menerima notifikasi atas tindakan Anda sendiri."

msgid ""
"Sending out notifications is limited, you will not receive more than 1000 e-"
"mails per day. Any further notifications for you will be discarded."
msgstr ""
"Pengiriman notifikasi dibatasi, Anda tidak akan menerima lebih dari 1000 "
"surel per hari. Notifikasi selanjutnya akan dihapus."

msgid "Account"
msgstr "Akun"

msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Account` tab lets you set up basic account details, connect "
"various services you can use to sign in into Weblate, completely remove your "
"account, or download your user data (see :ref:`schema-userdata`)."
msgstr ""
"Tab :guilabel:`Akun` memungkinkan Anda mengatur rincian akun dasar, "
"menghubungkan berbagai layanan yang dapat Anda gunakan untuk masuk ke "
"Weblate, menghapus akun Anda sepenuhnya, atau mengunduh data pengguna Anda "
"(lihat :ref:`schema-userdata`)."

msgid ""
"The private commit e-mail will be used instead of your account e-mail in "
"version control commits. Use this to avoid leaking your real e-mail there. "
"Be aware that using different e-mail can disconnect your contributions on "
"other servers (for example your contributions will no longer link to your "
"profile on GitHub). The private e-mail can be turned on site-wide "
"using :setting:`PRIVATE_COMMIT_EMAIL_OPT_IN`."
msgstr ""
"Surel komit privat akan digunakan sebagai pengganti surel akun Anda dalam "
"komit kontrol versi. Gunakan ini untuk menghindari kebocoran surel asli Anda "
"di sana. Perlu diketahui bahwa penggunaan surel yang berbeda dapat "
"memutuskan kontribusi Anda di server lain (misalnya, kontribusi Anda tidak "
"akan lagi tertaut ke profil Anda di GitHub). Surel privat dapat diaktifkan "
"di seluruh situs menggunakan :setting:`PRIVATE_COMMIT_EMAIL_OPT_IN`."

msgid ""
"The list of services depends on your Weblate configuration, but can be made "
"to include popular sites such as GitLab, GitHub, Google, Facebook, or "
"Bitbucket or other OAuth 2.0 providers."
msgstr ""
"Daftar layanan bergantung pada konfigurasi Weblate Anda, tetapi dapat dibuat "
"untuk menyertakan situs populer seperti GitLab, GitHub, Google, Facebook, "
"atau Bitbucket atau penyedia OAuth 2.0 lainnya."

msgid "Profile"
msgstr "Profil"

msgid ""
"All of the fields on this page are optional and can be deleted at any time, "
"and by filling them out, you're giving us consent to share this data "
"wherever your user profile appears."
msgstr ""
"Semua kolom di halaman ini bersifat opsional dan dapat dihapus kapan saja, "
"dan dengan mengisinya, Anda memberi kami izin untuk membagikan data ini di "
"mana pun profil pengguna Anda muncul."

msgid ""
"Public profile URLs, such as :guilabel:`Website URL`, :guilabel:`Contact "
"URL`, :guilabel:`Fediverse URL`, and :guilabel:`Code site URL`, should point "
"to a website, contact, or profile page. Obvious direct file download links "
"can be rejected, and public profile links show a warning before leaving "
"Weblate where possible."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Code site URL` should use common code-hosting profile paths, "
"such as ``/username`` or ``/~username``; existing repository-style links "
"such as ``/username/project`` or ``/group/subgroup/project`` are also "
"accepted. The :guilabel:`Fediverse URL` should use common profile paths, "
"such as ``/username``, ``/@username``, ``/web/@username``, ``/users/"
"username``, ``/accounts/username``, ``/channel/username``, ``/profile/"
"username``, ``/u/username``, or ``/people/identifier``."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Avatar can be shown for each user (depending on :setting:`ENABLE_AVATARS`). "
"These images are obtained using https://gravatar.com/."
msgstr ""
"Avatar dapat ditampilkan untuk setiap pengguna (tergantung "
"pada :setting:`ENABLE_AVATARS`). Gambar ini diperoleh menggunakan https://"
"gravatar.com/."

msgid "Licenses"
msgstr "Lisensi"

msgid "API access"
msgstr "Akses API"

msgid "You can get or reset your API access token here."
msgstr ""
"Anda bisa mendapatkan atau mengatur ulang token akses API Anda di sini."

msgid "Audit log"
msgstr "Catatan audit"

msgid ""
"Audit log keeps track of the actions performed with your account. It logs IP "
"address and browser for every important action with your account. The "
"critical actions also trigger a notification to a primary e-mail address."
msgstr ""
"Catatan audit mencatat tindakan yang dilakukan dengan akun Anda. Catatan ini "
"mencatat alamat IP dan peramban untuk setiap tindakan penting dengan akun "
"Anda. Tindakan penting ini juga memicu notifikasi ke alamat surel utama."

msgid "Searching"
msgstr "Mencari"

