msgid ""
"You can combine lookups using ``AND``, ``OR``, ``NOT`` and parentheses to "
"form complex queries. Boolean operators are case-insensitive, so ``and``, "
"``And`` and ``AND`` are equivalent."
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat menggabungkan pencarian menggunakan ``AND``, ``OR``, ``NOT`` dan "
"tanda kurung untuk membentuk kueri yang kompleks."

msgid ""
"The ``NOT`` operator has higher precedence than the ``AND`` operator; the "
"``AND`` operator has higher precedence than the ``OR`` operator. You can add "
"parenthesis to define a precedence of your own."
msgstr ""
"Operator ``NOT`` memiliki prioritas lebih tinggi daripada operator ``AND``; "
"operator ``AND`` memiliki prioritas lebih tinggi daripada operator ``OR``. "
"Anda dapat menambahkan tanda kurung untuk menentukan prioritas Anda sendiri."

msgid ""
"Omitting the operator will make the query behave like the ``AND`` operator "
"was used."
msgstr ""
"Menghilangkan operator akan membuat kueri berperilaku seperti operator "
"``AND`` yang digunakan."

msgid "Equivalent expressions"
msgstr "Ekspresi yang setara"

msgid "Parenthesized expression to clearly show the precedence."
msgstr "Ekspresi dalam tanda kurung untuk menunjukkan prioritas dengan jelas."

msgid "The ``AND`` operator has higher precedence than the ``OR`` operator."
msgstr ""
"Operator ``AND`` mempunyai prioritas lebih tinggi daripada operator ``OR``."

msgid "Query using an implicit ``AND`` operator."
msgstr "Kueri menggunakan operator ``AND`` implisit."

msgid "Field operators"
msgstr "Operator kolom"

msgid ""
"You can specify operators, ranges or partial lookups for date or numeric "
